<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Adiyisɛm</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yohane Adiyisɛm</para>
  <para style="toc2">Adiyisɛm</para>
  <para style="toc3">Adi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohane Adiyisɛm</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1"/>Nwoma yi fa adiyisɛm a Onyankopɔn de maa Yesu Kristo sɛ ɔnkyerɛ nʼasomfoɔ deɛ ɛrebɛba no ho. Kristo somaa ne ɔbɔfoɔ kɔɔ nʼakoa Yohane nkyɛn kɔdaa asɛm yi adi kyerɛɛ no, <verse eid="REV 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2"/>sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a Yohane bɛka biribiara a ɔhunuiɛ. Yei ne nʼadansedie ne asɛm a ɛfiri Onyankopɔn nkyɛn ne nokorɛ a Yesu Kristo daa no adi no. <verse eid="REV 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3"/>Nhyira nka obiara a ɔbɛkan saa nwoma yi, na nhyira nka wɔn nso a wɔtie adiyisɛm no na wɔdi so sɛdeɛ wɔatwerɛ wɔ saa nwoma yi mu no. Ɛberɛ no abɛn.<verse eid="REV 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s1">Nkyea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4"/>Yohane,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 1:4"/>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Nkyea a ɔkyea asafo ahodoɔ nson a ɛwɔ Asia no nie:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 1:4"/>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Adom ne asomdwoeɛ a ɛfiri deɛ ɔwɔ hɔ, na ɔtenaa hɔ, na ɔreba no ne ahonhom nson a wɔwɔ nʼahennwa anim, <verse eid="REV 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5"/>ne Yesu Kristo a ɔyɛ ɔdanseni nokwafoɔ ne awufoɔ mu abakan ne asase so ahene sodifoɔ no nkyɛn nka mo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 1:5"/>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 1:5"/>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Ɔdɔ yɛn, na ɔnam ne wuo no so agye yɛn afiri yɛn bɔne mu. <verse eid="REV 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6"/>Wayɛ yɛn ahemman ne asɔfoɔ sɛ yɛnsom ne Onyankopɔn ne nʼAgya. Ɔno na wɔmfa animuonyam ne tumi mma no daa daa! Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7"/>Ɔnam omununkum mu reba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">Wɔn a wɔwɔɔ no pea no</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 1:7">ne obiara bɛhunu no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">Asase so nnipa nyinaa bɛsu no.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:7">Ɛbɛba mu saa. Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8"/>Awurade Onyankopɔn Otumfoɔ no se, “Mene Alfa ne Omega<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hela atwerɛdeɛ a ɛdi ɛkan ne deɛ ɛtwa toɔ. Onyankopɔn yɛ ahyɛaseɛ ne awieeɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 21:6">21.6</ref></char>). </char></note> a ɔwɔ hɔ seesei na ɔwɔ hɔ dada na ɔrebɛba no.”<verse eid="REV 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9"/>Mene Yohane, a me ne mo nyinaa yɛ akyidifoɔ. Yɛhunu amane ɛfiri sɛ Yesu ne yɛn ɔhene, na ɔma yɛn ahoɔden wɔ ahohia mu. Esiane sɛ mekaa Onyankopɔn asɛm kaa nokorɛ a Yesu daa no adi enti, wɔtwaa me asuo de me kɔɔ Supɔ Patmo so. <verse eid="REV 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10"/>Awurade da no,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yudafoɔ da a ɛdi nnawɔtwe no ɛkan no. Wɔfrɛɛ da no saa, ɛfiri sɛ, saa da no na Yesu sɔre firii awufoɔ mu. Saa ɛda no ara nso na Akristofoɔ hyiaeɛ (Hwɛ <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 20:7">Aso 20.7</ref></char>) na wɔgyegyee toɔ (Hwɛ <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 16:2">1 Ko 16.2</ref></char>).</char></note> Honhom no faa me na metee nne denden bi a ɛte sɛ totorobɛnto a ɛrebɔ wɔ mʼakyi. <verse eid="REV 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11"/>Ɛkaa sɛ, “Twerɛ biribiara a wohunu, na fa nwoma no kɔma saa asafo ahodoɔ nson a ɛwɔ Efeso ne Smirna ne Pergamo ne Tiatira ne Sardi ne Filadelfia ne Laodikea no.”<verse eid="REV 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12"/>Medanee mʼani pɛɛ sɛ mehunu deɛ ɔrekasa kyerɛ me no. Ɛhɔ na mehunuu sikakɔkɔɔ nkaneadua nson. <verse eid="REV 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13"/>Na nkaneadua no mfimfini na onipa bi a ɔte sɛ Onipa Ba a ɔhyɛ atadeɛ yuu a ɛsi ne nan ase a sika abɔsoɔ kyekyere ne koko no gyina. <verse eid="REV 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14"/>Na ne tirinwi yɛ fitaa te sɛ asaawafuturo anaasɛ sukyerɛmma, na nʼani dɛre sɛ ogya. <verse eid="REV 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15"/>Ne nan ase hyerɛnee sɛ ayowaa a wɔanane wɔ fononoo mu na afei wɔatwi ho na ne nne woro so te sɛ nsuworosoɔ a ano yɛ den. <verse eid="REV 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16"/>Na ɔkura nsoromma nson wɔ ne nsa nifa mu na sekan anofanu a ɛyɛ nnam firi nʼanom baeɛ. Na nʼanim hyerɛn te sɛ owigyinaeɛ awia.<verse eid="REV 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17"/>Mehunuu no no, mekɔhwee ne nan ase te sɛ owufoɔ. Ɔde ne nsa nifa too me so kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsuro! Mene Ɔkannifoɔ ne Okyikafoɔ.</char> <verse eid="REV 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18"/><char style="wj">Mene ɔteasefoɔ no! Mewuiɛ, nanso seesei mete ase daa daa. Mekura owuo ne asaman safoa.</char><verse eid="REV 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti afei twerɛ nneɛma a wohunu; deɛ wohunu no seesei ne deɛ ɛbɛba akyire no, twerɛ.</char> <verse eid="REV 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20"/><char style="wj">Nsoromma nson a wohunu wɔ me nsa nifa mu ne sika nkaneadua no nkyerɛaseɛ a ɛyɛ ahintasɛm no ni; Nsoromma nson no yɛ asafo nson no abɔfoɔ, ɛnna nkaneadua nson no nso yɛ asafo nson no.”</char><verse eid="REV 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Efeso Asafo No Nwoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Twerɛ krataa yi kɔma ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtua Efeso asafo no ano, na ka kyerɛ no sɛ:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:1"/>
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 2:1">
    <char style="wj">Yei ne nsɛm a ɛfiri obi a ɔkura nsoromma nson wɔ ne nsa nifa mu a ɔnante wɔ sika nkaneadua nson no ntam no.</char><verse eid="REV 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2"/>
    <char style="wj">Menim deɛ woayɛ. Menim nsi a wode ayɛ adwuma ne boasetɔ a wowɔ. Menim sɛ wonnye nnebɔneyɛfoɔ, na afei woasɔ wɔn a wɔka sɛ wɔyɛ asomafoɔ nanso wɔnnyɛ bi no ahwɛ, na woahunu sɛ wɔyɛ atorofoɔ.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3"/><char style="wj">Wowɔ boasetɔ, na me enti, woahunu amane bebree, nanso wompaa aba.</char><verse eid="REV 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4"/>
    <char style="wj">Nanso, deɛ mewɔ tia wo ne sɛ, wonnɔ me, sɛdeɛ kan no na wodɔ me no.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5"/><char style="wj">Hunu ba a woaba fam no. Te wo ho firi bɔne ho na yɛ sɛdeɛ kane no na woyɛ no. Sɛ woantwe wo ho amfiri wo bɔne ho a, mɛba wo nkyɛn na mabɛyi wo kaneadua no afiri ne siberɛ.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6"/><char style="wj">Nanso, deɛ ɛyɛ wɔ wo ho ne sɛ, wokyiri deɛ Nikolaifoɔ no yɛ no, na saa ara na me nso mekyiri.</char><verse eid="REV 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7"/>
    <char style="wj">Deɛ ɔwɔ aso no ntie deɛ Honhom no ka kyerɛ asafo ahodoɔ no bi. Wɔn a wɔadi nkonim no, mɛma wɔn tumi na wɔadi nkwadua a ɛwɔ Onyankopɔn paradise hɔ.</char><verse eid="REV 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Smirna Asafo No Nwoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Twerɛ krataa yi kɔma ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtua Smirna asafo no ano sɛ:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:8"/>
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 2:8">
    <char style="wj">Saa asɛm yi firi Ahyɛaseɛ ne Awieeɛ no nkyɛn. Deɛ ɔwuiɛ na ɔnyaneeɛ no.</char><verse eid="REV 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9"/>
    <char style="wj">Menim amane a wohunu maa Awurade na menim wʼahiasɛm nyinaa nso, nanso wowɔ agyapadeɛ wɔ ɔsoro. Menim nsɛm a wɔn a wɔse wɔyɛ Yudafoɔ nanso wɔnyɛ Yudafoɔ no ka tia wo. Wɔyɛ ɔbonsam apamfoɔ.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10"/><char style="wj">Nsuro ɔhaw a ɛrebɛto wo no. Tie! Wɔde mo mu bi bɛto afiase na ɔbonsam nam so asɔ mo ahwɛ. Na mo haw bɛdi dadu. Sɛ owuo mu mpo a, gye me di na mɛma wo nkwa abotire.</char><verse eid="REV 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11"/>
    <char style="wj">Deɛ ɔwɔ aso no ntie deɛ Honhom no ka kyerɛ asafo no. Wɔn a wɔdi nkonim no renwu owuprenu.</char><verse eid="REV 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pergamo Asafo No Nwoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Twerɛ krataa yi kɔma ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔwɔ Pergamo asafo mu sɛ:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:12"/>
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 2:12">
    <char style="wj">Saa krataa yi firi deɛ ɔwɔ akofena anofanu a ɛyɛ nnam no nkyɛn.</char><verse eid="REV 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13"/>
    <char style="wj">Menim sɛ faako a wote no, ɛhɔ na ɔbonsam ahennwa si. Wodi me nokorɛ; na ɛberɛ a wɔkumm Antipa a ɔyɛ ɔdanseni nokwafoɔ wɔ faako a ɔbonsam te no mpo, woampa me.</char><verse eid="REV 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14"/>
    <char style="wj">Nanso, nneɛma kakra a mewɔ tia wo ne sɛ, nnipa bi a wɔdi Bileam nkyerɛkyerɛ</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">2.14 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Bileam tuu Midianfoɔ mmaa fo kyerɛɛ wɔn kwammɔne a wɔmfa so nni Israelfoɔ no anim mfa wɔn nkɔ bɔne mu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-2">4 Mose 25.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 31:16">31.16</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:11">Yud 11</ref></char>).</char>
    </note> <char style="wj">akyi no ka wo ho wɔ hɔ. Saa Bileam no na ɔkyerɛɛ Balak maa ɔmaa Israelfoɔ dii abosom so nnuane, kyerɛɛ wɔn adwamammɔ, nam so ma wɔyɛɛ bɔne no.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na wowɔ nnipa bi ka wo ho a wɔdi Nikolaifoɔ nkyerɛkyerɛ akyi.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16"/><char style="wj">Twe wo ho firi wo bɔne ho. Anyɛ saa a, ɛrenkyɛre biara mɛba wo nkyɛn, na mede sekan a ɛfiri mʼanom no abɛko atia saa nnipa no.</char><verse eid="REV 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17"/>
    <char style="wj">Deɛ ɔwɔ aso no ntie deɛ Honhom no ka kyerɛ asafo ahodoɔ no. Mo a moadi nkonim no, mɛma mo mana a ahinta no bi. Afei, mɛma wɔn mu biara ɛboɔ fitaa a wɔatwerɛ din foforɔ wɔ so a obiara nnim, gye onipa a wɔde bɛma no no.</char><verse eid="REV 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tiatira Asafo No Nwoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Twerɛ krataa kɔma ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔwɔ Tiatira asafo mu sɛ:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:18"/>
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 2:18">
    <char style="wj">Yei ne asɛm a ɛfiri Onyankopɔn Ba no a nʼani dɛre sɛ ogyaframa a ne nan ase hyerɛn sɛ ayowaa no nkyɛn.</char><verse eid="REV 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19"/>
    <char style="wj">Menim deɛ woyɛ. Menim wo dɔ, wo gyidie, wo som ne boasetɔ a wowɔ. Menim sɛ woreyɛ adwuma sene kane no.</char><verse eid="REV 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20"/>
    <char style="wj">Nanso deɛ mewɔ tia wo ne sɛ, wogyee ɔbaa bi a ne din de Isabel, a ɔfrɛ ne ho, Onyankopɔn odiyifoɔ no too mu. Saa ɔbaa yi kyerɛkyerɛ, na ɔdi mʼasomafoɔ anim ma wɔbɔ adwaman di abosom aduane.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21"/><char style="wj">Mama no ɛberɛ sɛ ɔnnu ne ho mfiri ne bɔne mu, nanso ɔmpɛ sɛ ɔsakyera firi nʼadwamammɔ mu.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22"/><char style="wj">Ɛno enti, sɛ wɔansesa amfiri amumuyɛ a wɔne no yɛeɛ no mu a, mɛto no ahwe mpa so na ɔno ne wɔn a wɔsɛe awadeɛ no ahunu amane a ano yɛ den yie.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23"/><char style="wj">Afei, mɛkum nʼakyidifoɔ no, na asafo no nyinaa bɛhunu sɛ mene obi a mehunu nnipa adwene mu ne wɔn akɔnnɔ. Deɛ mo mu biara yɛeɛ no, mɛtua no so ka pɛpɛɛpɛ.</char><verse eid="REV 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24"/>
    <char style="wj">Nanso, momu bi a mowɔ Tiatira no nni saa nkyerɛkyerɛ bɔne no akyi. Monsuaa deɛ afoforɔ frɛ no ‘Ɔbonsam asumansɛm’ no. Meka mekyerɛ mo sɛ, meremfa adesoa foforɔ biara nto mo so.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25"/><char style="wj">Na monsɔ deɛ mowɔ no mu denden kɔsi sɛ mɛba.</char><verse eid="REV 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26"/>
    <char style="wj">Wɔn a wɔdi nkonim na wɔkɔ so yɛ deɛ mepɛ kɔsi awieeɛ no, mede tumi korɔ no ara a menya firii</char> <verse eid="REV 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27"/><char style="wj">mʼAgya hɔ no bɛma wɔn. Mɛma wɔn aman so tumi na wɔde dadeɛ poma adi wɔn so na wɔabobɔ wɔn sɛ nkukuo.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28"/><char style="wj">Afei, mede anɔpa nsoromma bɛma wɔn.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɔwɔ aso no ntie deɛ Honhom no ka kyerɛ asafo no.</char><verse eid="REV 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Sardi Asafo No Nwoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Twerɛ krataa yi kɔma ɔbɔfoɔ ɔwɔ asafo a ɛwɔ Sardi no sɛ:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:1"/>
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 3:1">
    <char style="wj">Yei ne asɛm a ɛfiri deɛ ɔwɔ Onyankopɔn ahonhom nson ne nsoromma nson no nkyɛn.</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:1"/>
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 3:1">
    <char style="wj">Menim deɛ woreyɛ. Menim sɛ woagye din sɛ wote ase, nanso woawu.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2"/><char style="wj">Enti nyane, na kanyane deɛ aka wo nkyɛn no na anwu koraa. Ɛfiri sɛ, mahunu sɛ deɛ woayɛ no nya nnii mu wɔ Onyankopɔn anim.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3"/><char style="wj">Kae deɛ wɔkyerɛɛ wo no ne sɛdeɛ woteeɛ no. Di so na twe wo ho firi wo bɔne ho. Sɛ woankanyane wo ho a, mɛba wo so sɛ ɔkorɔmfoɔ, na worenhunu ɛberɛ ko a mɛba.</char><verse eid="REV 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4"/>
    <char style="wj">Nanso, mo mu kakra bi a wɔwɔ Sardi no mfaa ewiase nkekaeɛ nkekaa wɔn ntadeɛ mu. Wɔne me bɛnante a wɔhyɛ ntadeɛ fitaa, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛsɛ wɔn sɛ wɔyɛ saa.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɔbɛdi nkonim no, wɔbɛhyɛ no atadeɛ fitaa, na merentwa ne din mfiri ateasefoɔ nwoma no mu. Na mɛda ne din adi wɔ mʼAgya no ne nʼabɔfoɔ anim sɛ ɔyɛ me dea.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɔwɔ aso no ntie deɛ Honhom no ka kyerɛ asafo no.</char><verse eid="REV 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Filadelfia Asafo No Nwoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Twerɛ krataa yi kɔma ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔwɔ asafo a ɛwɔ Filadelfia no sɛ:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:7"/>
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 3:7">
    <char style="wj">Yei ne asɛm a ɛfiri deɛ ɔyɛ kronkron na ɔyɛ nokorɛ na ɔkura Dawid safoa no nkyɛn. Deɛ ɔbue a, obi ntumi nto mu na sɛ ɔto mu nso a, obi ntumi mmue no.</char><verse eid="REV 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8"/>
    <char style="wj">Menim deɛ woyɛ. Menim sɛ wowɔ tumi kakra. Woadi me nkyerɛkyerɛ no so, nam so adi me nokorɛ. Mabue ɛpono bi wɔ wʼanim a obi ntumi nto mu.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9"/><char style="wj">Tie! Ekuo a ɔbonsam afa wɔn no, saa atorofoɔ a wɔka sɛ wɔyɛ Yudafoɔ nanso wɔnyɛ bi no, mɛma wɔaba wʼanim abɛbu wo nkotodwe. Wɔn nyinaa bɛhunu sɛ medɔ wo.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10"/><char style="wj">Esiane sɛ woadi me mmara so anya boasetɔ enti, sɛ ɔhaw a ɛreba ewiase nyinaa de asɔ asase so nnipa nyinaa ahwɛ no ba a, mɛgye wo afiri mu.</char><verse eid="REV 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11"/>
    <char style="wj">Mereba nnansa yi ara. Kora wʼagyapadeɛ, na obi anwia wo nkonim abotire no.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɔbɛdi nkonim no, mɛyɛ no odum me Onyankopɔn asɔredan mu, na ɔremfiri mu bio da. Mɛtwerɛ me Onyankopɔn din ne me Onyankopɔn kuro din a ɛyɛ Yerusalem foforɔ a ɛbɛfiri ɔsoro me Onyankopɔn nkyɛn aba no agu ne ho. Bio, mɛtwerɛ me din foforɔ agu ne ho.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ɔwɔ aso no ntie deɛ Honhom no ka kyerɛ asafo no.</char><verse eid="REV 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laodikea Asafo No Nwoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Twerɛ krataa yi kɔma ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔwɔ Laodikea asafo mu no sɛ:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:14"/>
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 3:14">
    <char style="wj">Yei ne asɛm a ɛfiri Amen a ɔyɛ ɔdanseni nokwafoɔ a ɔyɛ biribiara a Onyankopɔn bɔeɛ no sodifoɔ nkyɛn.</char><verse eid="REV 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15"/>
    <char style="wj">Menim deɛ woayɛ. Menim sɛ wonyɛ nwunu nso wonyɛ hye. Me pɛ ne sɛ, anka wobɛyɛ mu baako.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16"/><char style="wj">Nanso, ɛsiane sɛ woyɛ boturobodwo, na wonyɛ hye na wonyɛ nwunu enti, merebɛte wo sɛ ntasuo afiri mʼanom.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17"/><char style="wj">Woka sɛ, ‘meyɛ ɔdefoɔ na manya me ho na mewɔ deɛ ɛhia me nyinaa.’ Nanso, wonnim hia a ahia wo ne mmɔborɔ a woyɛ. Woyɛ ohiani. Woda adagya, na wʼani afira.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18"/><char style="wj">Enti, metu wo fo sɛ tɔ sikakɔkɔɔ, sikakɔkɔɔ amapa, firi me nkyɛn, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛma woayɛ ɔdefoɔ. Afei, tɔ ntadeɛ fitaa hyɛ fa kata wʼanimguaseɛ adagya no so. Afei, tɔ aduro gu wʼani so, sɛdeɛ wobɛhunu adeɛ.</char><verse eid="REV 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19"/>
    <char style="wj">Mekɔ so twe wɔn a medɔ wɔn no nyinaa aso. Enti bɔ mmɔden na twe wo ho firi bɔne ho.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20"/><char style="wj">Tie! Megyina ɛpono no akyi rebɔ mu; sɛ obi te me nne na ɔbue ɛpono no a, mɛba mu na me ne no adidi na ɔno nso ne me adidi.</char><verse eid="REV 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21"/>
    <char style="wj">Mɛma nkonimdifoɔ no atena mʼahennwa no ho, sɛdeɛ madi nkonim enti, mete mʼAgya ahennwa ho seesei no.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wowɔ aso a, ɛnneɛ tie deɛ Honhom no ka kyerɛ asafo no.”</char><verse eid="REV 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsoro Pono A Wɔabue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1"/>Yei akyiri no, mehwɛ mehunuu ɛpono a abue wɔ ɔsoro. Na ɛnne bi akasa akyerɛ me pɛn na ɛgyegye sɛ totorobɛnto kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Bra ɔsoro ha, na mɛkyerɛ wo deɛ ɛbɛba yei akyi.”</char> <verse eid="REV 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2"/>Prɛko pɛ, na Honhom no faa me. Na ahennwa bi si ɔsoro hɔ a obi te so. <verse eid="REV 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3"/>Na nʼanim hyerɛn te sɛ ahwehwɛboɔ ne mogyanamboɔ. Na nyankontɔn a ɛte sɛ ahahammonoboɔ atwa ahennwa no ho ahyia. <verse eid="REV 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4"/>Na ahennwa nketewa aduonu nan atwa ahennwa kɛseɛ no ho ahyia a mpanimfoɔ aduonu ɛnan na wɔtete so a wɔhyehyɛ ntadeɛ fitaa ne sikakɔkɔɔ ahenkyɛ. <verse eid="REV 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5"/>Na anyinam ne aprannaa bobom firi ahennwa no mu. Na nkanea nson a wɔasosɔ redɛre wɔ ahennwa no anim. Yeinom yɛ Onyankopɔn ahonhom nson. <verse eid="REV 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6"/>Na biribi te sɛ ahwehwɛ ɛpo a ɛyɛ korɔgyenn sɛ ahwehwɛ da ahennwa no anim.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Ahennwa no fa biara, na ateasefoɔ baanan a ani tuatua wɔn anim ne wɔn akyi atwa ahennwa no ho ahyia. <verse eid="REV 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7"/>Na ɔteasefoɔ a ɔdi ɛkan no te sɛ gyata; deɛ ɔtɔ so mmienu no te sɛ nantwie ba; deɛ ɔtɔ so mmiɛnsa no anim te sɛ onipa; ɛnna deɛ ɔtɔ so nan no te sɛ ɔkɔdeɛ a ɔretu. <verse eid="REV 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8"/>Na ateasefoɔ baanan no mu biara wɔ ntaban nsia a ani tuatua akyire ne animu nyinaa. Anadwo ne awia nyinaa na wɔto dwom sɛ,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">“Kronkron, Kronkron</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">ne Awurade Onyankopɔn Otumfoɔ a</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">ɔtenaa hɔ na ɔwɔ hɔ na ɔrebɛba no.”<verse eid="REV 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9"/>Saa ateasefoɔ baanan no to nnwom de hyɛ deɛ ɔte ahennwa no so a ɔte hɔ daa daa no animuonyam, de ma no anidie, da no ase. Sɛ wɔyɛ saa a, <verse eid="REV 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10"/>mpanimfoɔ aduonu ɛnan no butubutu deɛ ɔte ahennwa no so no anim som deɛ ɔte hɔ daa daa no. Wɔto wɔn ahenkyɛ gu ahennwa no anim ka sɛ:<verse eid="REV 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11"/>“Yɛn Awurade ne Onyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">wofata sɛ wonya animuonyam, anidie ne tumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">ɛfiri sɛ, wo na wobɔɔ nneɛma nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">na wo pɛ mu enti na wɔte hɔ.”<verse eid="REV 4:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsɔano Nwoma No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1"/>Mehunuu sɛ deɛ ɔte ahennwa so no kura nwoma bi wɔ ne nsa nifa mu. Na wɔatwerɛ akyire ne animu nyinaa a wɔde nsɔano nson asosɔ ano. <verse eid="REV 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2"/>Mehunuu ɔbɔfoɔ hoɔdenfoɔ bi a ɔde nne kɛseɛ kaa sɛ, “Hwan na ɔfata sɛ ɔte nsɔano no na ɔbue nwoma no mu?” <verse eid="REV 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3"/>Nanso, wɔannya obiara a ɔwɔ ɔsoro anaa asase so anaa asase ase a ɔtumi buee nwoma no mu hwɛɛ mu. <verse eid="REV 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4"/>Mesuu yie, ɛfiri sɛ wɔannya obiara a ɔfata sɛ ɔbue nwoma no mu na ɔhwɛ mu. <verse eid="REV 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5"/>Afei, ɔpanin baako ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Nsu. Hwɛ! Gyata a ɔfiri Yuda abusuakuo mu a ɔyɛ Dawid aseni adi nkonim, na ɔbɛtumi atete nsɔano nson no na wabue nwoma no mu.”<verse eid="REV 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6"/>Afei, mehunuu Odwammaa bi sɛ ɔgyina ahennwa no mfimfini a ateasefoɔ baanan no ne mpanimfoɔ no atwa ne ho ahyia. Wɔhwɛ a na ɛsɛ deɛ wɔakum Odwammaa no. Na ɔwɔ mmɛn nson ne aniwa nson a ɛgyina hɔ ma Onyankopɔn ahonhom nson no a wɔasoma wɔn aba ewiase no. <verse eid="REV 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7"/>Odwammaa no kɔgyee nwoma no firii deɛ ɔte ahennwa so no nsa nifa mu. <verse eid="REV 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8"/>Ɔyɛɛ saa no, ateasefoɔ baanan no ne mpanimfoɔ aduonu ɛnan no butubutuu Odwammaa no anim. Na wɔn mu biara kura sankuo ne sika ayowaa a aduhwam ayɛ no ma a ɛyɛ ahotefoɔ mpaeɛ. <verse eid="REV 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9"/>Wɔtoo dwom foforɔ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">“Wofata sɛ wofa nwoma no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">na wote ne nsɔano no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">ɛfiri sɛ wɔkumm wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">na ɛnam wo wuo so maa wɔtɔɔ nnipa firii aman ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">mmusuakuo ne nkurɔfoɔ ne kasa nyinaa mu maa Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="REV 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10"/>Wɔayɛ wɔn asɔfoɔ ahemman sɛ wɔnsom yɛn Onyankopɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">na wɔbɛdi asase so ɔhene.”<verse eid="REV 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11"/>Bio mehwɛeɛ, tee abɔfoɔ mpempem nka. Na wɔatwa ahennwa no ne ateasefoɔ baanan no ne mpanimfoɔ no ho ahyia <verse eid="REV 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12"/>reto dwom denden sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">“Odwammaa a wɔkumm no no fata sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">ɔgye tumi, ahonya, nyansa ne ahoɔden</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">ne anidie ne animuonyam ne nkamfoɔ!”<verse eid="REV 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13"/>Na metee sɛ abɔdeɛ a wɔwɔ ɔsoro, asase so, asase ase ne abɔdeɛ biara a wɔwɔ ɛpo mu ne abɔdeɛ biara a wɔwɔ ewiase nyinaa reto dwom sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">“Nhyira ne anidie ne animuonyam ne tumi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">nka deɛ ɔte ahennwa no so ne Odwammaa no,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:13">daa daa!”<verse eid="REV 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14"/>Abɔdeɛ ɛnan no gyee so sɛ, “Amen!” Na mpanimfoɔ no butubutuu hɔ someeɛ.<verse eid="REV 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsɔano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1"/>Afei, mehunuu sɛ Odwammaa no ate nsɔano nson no mu deɛ ɛdi ɛkan ano, na metee sɛ ateasefoɔ baanan no mu baako de nne a ɛte sɛ aprannaa reka sɛ, “Bra!” <verse eid="REV 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2"/>Mehwɛeɛ, na mehunuu ɔpɔnkɔ fitaa bi wɔ hɔ. Na deɛ ɔte ne so no kura agyan na wɔmaa no ahenkyɛ. Ɔkɔeɛ sɛ nkonimdifoɔ kɔdii nkonim.<verse eid="REV 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3"/>Afei, Odwammaa no tee nsɔano a ɛtɔ so mmienu no ano, na metee sɛ ɔteasefoɔ a ɔtɔ so mmienu no reka sɛ, “Bra!” <verse eid="REV 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4"/>Ɔpɔnkɔ foforɔ a ɔyɛ kɔkɔɔ baeɛ. Wɔmaa deɛ ɔte ne so no tumi sɛ ɔmfa ɔko mmra asase so na nnipa nkunkum wɔn ho. Wɔmaa no akofena kɛseɛ bi.<verse eid="REV 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5"/>Afei, Odwammaa no tee nsɔano a ɛtɔ so mmiɛnsa no ano, na metee sɛ ɔteasefoɔ a ɔtɔ so mmiɛnsa no reka sɛ, “Bra!” Mehwɛeɛ, na mehunuu ɔpɔnkɔ tuntum bi wɔ hɔ. Ne kafoɔ no kura nsania mmienu. <verse eid="REV 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6"/>Metee biribi te sɛ nne bi firi ateasefoɔ baanan no nkyɛn. Na nne no se, “Ayuo susukora yɛ ɛda koro akatua, ɛnna aburoo susukora mmiɛnsa nso yɛ ɛda koro akatua. Nanso, nsɛe nsrango no ne bobesa no!”<verse eid="REV 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7"/>Afei, Odwammaa no tee nsɔano a ɛtɔ so nan no ano na metee sɛ ɔteasefoɔ a ɔtɔ so nan no reka sɛ, “Bra!” <verse eid="REV 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8"/>Mehwɛeɛ na mehunuu ɔpɔnkɔ nsonso bi. Wɔtoo ne sotefoɔ no din “Owuo”, na Asaman di nʼakyi pɛɛ. Wɔmaa no asase nkyɛmu nan mu baako so tumi sɛ ɔmfa ɔko, ɔkɔm, yadeɛ ne nkekaboa a wɔwɔ asase so nkunkum wɔn.<verse eid="REV 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9"/>Afei Odwammaa no tee nsɔano a ɛtɔ so enum no ano. Mehunuu afɔrebukyia bi, na aseɛ na wɔn a wɔkumm wɔn wɔ asɛnka no ho na wɔde gyidie dii adanseɛ no akra wɔ. <verse eid="REV 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10"/>Wɔde nne a ano yɛ den kaa sɛ, “Otumfoɔ Awurade, Ɔkronkronni ne Nokwafoɔ! Woretwɛn akɔsi da bɛn ansa na wɔabu nnipa a wɔwɔ asase so atɛn, na wɔatwe wɔn aso sɛ wɔkunkum yɛn?” <verse eid="REV 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11"/>Wɔmaa wɔn mu biara atadeɛ fitaa, na wɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔntwɛn kakra kɔsi sɛ wɔbɛkum wɔn nuanom asomfoɔ abɛka wɔn ho.<verse eid="REV 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12"/>Na mehunuu sɛ Odwammaa no tee nsɔano a ɛtɔ so nsia no ano. Na asasewosoɔ a ano yɛ den baeɛ maa owia yɛɛ tumm sɛ ayitoma, na ɔsrane yɛɛ kɔɔ sɛ mogya. <verse eid="REV 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13"/>Na nsoromma tete firii soro bɛhwee asase so te sɛ deɛ mframa a ano yɛ den bɔ borɔdɔma bunu ma ɛtete gu fam pɛ. <verse eid="REV 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14"/>Ɔsoro yeraeɛ te sɛ nwoma a wɔabobɔ, na mmepɔ ne nsupɔ firii wɔn atenaeɛ.<verse eid="REV 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15"/>Na asase so ahemfo ne nnipa akɛseɛ ne asafohene ne adefoɔ ne ahoɔdenfoɔ ne nkoa ne adehyeɛ nyinaa hintahintaa abodan ne mmepɔ mu abotan mu. <verse eid="REV 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16"/>Na wɔka kyerɛɛ mmepɔ no ne abotan no sɛ, “Monkata yɛn so na momfa yɛn nsie, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, deɛ ɔte ahennwa no so no ani renhunu yɛn, na yɛmfiri Odwammaa no abufuo ano. <verse eid="REV 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17"/>Wɔn abufuo no ɛda kɛseɛ aduru, na hwan na ɔbɛtumi agyina ano?”<verse eid="REV 6:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Asomfoɔ Kann</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1"/>Yei akyi no, mehunuu abɔfoɔ baanan sɛ, wɔgyinagyina asase ntweaa nan no so a wɔretwe mframa nan a ɛwɔ asase so no, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a mframa biara remmɔ wɔ asase ne ɛpo so ne baabiara. <verse eid="REV 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2"/>Ɛnna mehunuu ɔbɔfoɔ foforɔ a ɔfiri apueeɛ reba a ɔkura Onyankopɔn a ɔte ase no nsɔano. Ɔteaam frɛɛ abɔfoɔ baanan no a na Onyankopɔn ama wɔn tumi sɛ wɔnsɛe asase ne ɛpo no. <verse eid="REV 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ no kaa sɛ, “Monnsɛe asase ne ɛpo anaa nnua kɔsi sɛ yɛde nsɔano bɛhyɛ Onyankopɔn asomfoɔ no agyiraeɛ.” <verse eid="REV 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4"/>Na wɔkyerɛɛ me wɔn a wɔde Onyankopɔn nsɔano hyɛɛ wɔn agyiraeɛ wɔ wɔn moma so no dodoɔ. Wɔn nyinaa dodoɔ yɛ ɔpeha aduanan ɛnan, a wɔn nyinaa firi Israel mmusuakuo no mu.<verse eid="REV 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5"/>Yuda abusuakuo mu nnipa a wɔsɔɔ wɔn ano si mpem dumienu <char style="add">(12,000)</char>.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:5">Ruben abusuakuo mu nnipa a wɔsɔɔ wɔn ano si mpem dumienu <char style="add">(12,000)</char>.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:5">Gad abusuakuo mu nnipa a wɔsɔɔ wɔn ano si mpem dumienu <char style="add">(12,000)</char>.<verse eid="REV 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6"/>Aser abusuakuo mu nnipa a wɔsɔɔ wɔn ano si mpem dumienu <char style="add">(12,000)</char>.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:6">Naftali abusuakuo mu nnipa a wɔsɔɔ wɔn ano si mpem dumienu <char style="add">(12,000)</char>.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:6">Manase abusuakuo mu nnipa a wɔsɔɔ wɔn ano si mpem dumienu <char style="add">(12,000)</char>.<verse eid="REV 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7"/>Simeon abusuakuo mu nnipa a wɔsɔɔ wɔn ano si mpem dumienu <char style="add">(12,000)</char>.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:7">Lewi abusuakuo mu nnipa a wɔsɔɔ wɔn ano si mpem dumienu <char style="add">(12,000)</char>.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:7">Isakar abusuakuo mu nnipa a wɔsɔɔ wɔn ano si mpem dumienu <char style="add">(12,000)</char>.<verse eid="REV 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8"/>Sebulon abusuakuo mu nnipa a wɔsɔɔ wɔn ano si mpem dumienu <char style="add">(12,000)</char>.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:8">Yosef abusuakuo mu nnipa a wɔsɔɔ wɔn ano si mpem dumienu <char style="add">(12,000)</char>.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:8">Benyamin abusuakuo mu nnipa a wɔsɔɔ wɔn ano si mpem dumienu <char style="add">(12,000)</char>.<verse eid="REV 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnipakuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9"/>Yei akyi no, mehunuu nnipakuo a obiara ntumi nkan wɔn dodoɔ. Wɔfifiri aman ne mmusuakuo ne nkurɔfoɔ ne kasa nyinaa mu a wɔgyinagyina ahennwa no ne Odwammaa no anim a wɔhyehyɛ ntadeɛ fitafitaa, kurakura berɛ. <verse eid="REV 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10"/>Wɔteaam sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">“Yɛn nkwagyeɛ firi yɛn Onyankopɔn</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">a ɔte ahennwa no so</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">ne Odwammaa no.”<verse eid="REV 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11"/>Na abɔfoɔ no atwa ahennwa no ne mpanimfoɔ no ne ateasefoɔ baanan no ho ahyia. Afei wɔbutubutuu ahennwa no anim, somm Onyankopɔn <verse eid="REV 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12"/>kaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">“Amen!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Nhyira ne animuonyam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">ne nyansa ne aseda ne anidie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">ne tumi ne ahoɔden</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">yɛ Onyankopɔn dea daa daa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Amen!”<verse eid="REV 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13"/>Mpanimfoɔ no mu baako bisaa me sɛ, “Ɛhefoɔ na wɔhyehyɛ ntadeɛ fitafitaa yi, na wɔfiri he?”<verse eid="REV 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14"/>Mebuaa sɛ, “Mennim, owura. Na wo na wonim.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Yeinom ne wɔn a wɔafiri ɔtaa mu. Wɔde Odwammaa no mogya ahoro wɔn ntadeɛ ama ayɛ fitaa. <verse eid="REV 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15"/>Na ɛno enti na,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">“wɔgyina Onyankopɔn ahennwa anim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">a wɔresom awia ne anadwo wɔ ne hyiadan mu yi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">Deɛ ɔbɛtena ahennwa no so no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">bɛbɔ wɔn ho ban.<verse eid="REV 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16"/>Sukɔm renne wɔn bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">ɛkɔm renne wɔn bio.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">Owia anaa ɔhyew biara renhye wɔn bio.<verse eid="REV 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, Odwammaa no a ɔwɔ ahennwa no mfimfini no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">bɛyɛ wɔn dwanhwɛfoɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:17">de wɔn akɔ nkwa asutire ho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">Na Onyankopɔn bɛpepa wɔn aniwa mu nisuo nyinaa.”<verse eid="REV 7:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsɔano A Ɛtɔ So Nson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1"/>Ɛberɛ a Odwammaa no tee nsɔano a ɛtɔ so nson no, ɔsoro nyinaa tɛm dinn bɛyɛ dɔnhwereɛ fa.<verse eid="REV 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2"/>Afei mehunuu abɔfoɔ baason a wɔgyinagyina Onyankopɔn anim. Wɔmemaa wɔn ntotorobɛnto nson.<verse eid="REV 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ foforɔ a na ɔwɔ sikakɔkɔɔ aduhwam adaka bɛgyinaa afɔrebukyia no ho. Wɔmaa no aduhwam bebree sɛ ɔmfa mmɔ mpaeɛ nka Onyankopɔn nkurɔfoɔ no deɛ ho, na ɔmmɔ sikakɔkɔɔ a ɛsi ahennwa no anim no so afɔdeɛ. <verse eid="REV 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4"/>Aduhwam no hwa ne Onyankopɔn nkurɔfoɔ mpaeɛ firi abɔfoɔ no nsam kɔɔ soro. <verse eid="REV 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5"/>Afei, ɔbɔfoɔ no faa aduhwam adaka no de ogya a ɛfiri afɔrebukyia no so hyɛɛ no ma, to twenee asase so. Na aprannaa ne nne ahodoɔ ne anyinam ne asasewosoɔ baeɛ.<verse eid="REV 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6"/>Na abɔfoɔ baason a wɔkurakura ntotorobɛnto nson no siesiee wɔn ho sɛ wɔrebɛhyɛne.<verse eid="REV 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔdi ɛkan no hyɛnee ne totorobɛnto. Na asukɔtweaa ne ogya a ɛne mogya adi afra tɔ guu asase so. Asase nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu baako hyeeɛ. Nnua nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu baako hyeeɛ, ɛnna wira mono nyinaa nso hyeeɛ.<verse eid="REV 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8"/>Afei, ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtɔ so mmienu no hyɛnee ne totorobɛnto. Wɔtoo biribi a ɛte sɛ bepɔ kɛseɛ a ɛrederɛ twenee ɛpo mu. Ɛpo no nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu baako danee mogya. <verse eid="REV 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9"/>Na abɔdeɛ a ɛwɔ nkwa a ɛwɔ ɛpo no mu nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu baako wuwuiɛ maa ahyɛn mu nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu baako bobɔeɛ.<verse eid="REV 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10"/>Afei, ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtɔ so mmiɛnsa hyɛnee ne totorobɛnto. Nsoromma kɛseɛ bi a ɛrederɛ sɛ egyatɛn te firi soro bɛhwee nsuo nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu baako mu. <verse eid="REV 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11"/>Nsoromma no din de “Ɔnwono”. Nsuo no nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu baako yɛɛ nwono, na nnipa a wɔnomeeɛ no mu bebree wuwuiɛ ɛfiri sɛ, na ayɛ nwono.<verse eid="REV 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12"/>Afei, ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtɔ so nan no hyɛnee ne totorobɛnto. Na wɔbɔɔ owia nkyekyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu baako, ne ɔsrane nkyekyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu baako ne nsoromma nkyekyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu baako seneeɛ maa no duduruu sum, enti adekyeeɛ mu nkyekyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu baako anhyerɛn, na anadwo nso saa ara.<verse eid="REV 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13"/>Na mehwɛeɛ na metee sɛ ɔkɔdeɛ bi a watu nam soro soro teaam sɛ, “Wɔn a wɔte asase so no nnue; wɔnnue, wɔnnue ɛsiane totorobɛnto a aka a abɔfoɔ baasa no rebɛhyɛn no enti.”<verse eid="REV 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Totorobɛnto A Ɛtɔ So Enum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1"/>Afei ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtɔ so enum no hyɛnee ne totorobɛnto. Mehunuu nsoromma a wate firi soro abɛhwe asase so. Wɔmaa no ebunu a ase nni awieeɛ safoa. <verse eid="REV 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2"/>Nsoromma no buee ebunu no, na wisie kumɔnn firii mu sɛ fononoo kɛseɛ bi, na wisie no maa owia hann ne mframa a ɛwɔ hɔ no yɛɛ tumm. <verse eid="REV 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3"/>Mmoadabi firii wisie no mu baa asase so, na wɔmaa wɔn tumi sɛ anyanyankyerɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4"/>Wɔama wɔn ansɛe ɛserɛ anaa nnua anaa afifideɛ biara, na mmom, nnipa a Onyankopɔn nsɔano no bi nni wɔn moma so no deɛ, wɔmaa wɔn twee wɔn aso. <verse eid="REV 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5"/>Wɔamma saa mmoadabi no ɛkwan sɛ wɔnkunkum saa nnipa yi. Na mmom, wɔmaa wɔn ɛkwan sɛ wɔnha wɔn abosome enum. Wɔka wɔn a, wɔn ano yea no te sɛ nyanyankyerɛ deɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6"/>Saa abosome enum no mu no, saa nnipa no bɛpere owuo, nanso wɔrennya. Wɔbɛpɛ sɛ wɔwu, nanso owuo bɛdwane afiri wɔn nkyɛn.<verse eid="REV 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7"/>Mmoadabi no te sɛ apɔnkɔ a wɔasiesie wɔn ama ɔko. Wɔwɔ biribi te sɛ sikakɔkɔɔ ahenkyɛ hyɛ wɔn ti. Na wɔn anim te sɛ nnipa anim. <verse eid="REV 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8"/>Wɔn tirinwi te sɛ mmaa tirinwi, ɛnna wɔn se nso te sɛ gyata se. <verse eid="REV 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9"/>Wɔde biribi te sɛ dadeɛ nkataboɔ akatakata wɔn bo. Na nnyegyeeɛ a wɔn ntaban yɛ no te sɛ apɔnkɔ bebree a wɔretwe nteaseɛnam akɔ ɔko. <verse eid="REV 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10"/>Wɔwɔ borɔ dua te sɛ anyanyankyerɛ. Na wɔn dua no enti na na wɔwɔ tumi a wɔde ha nnipa abosome enum no. <verse eid="REV 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11"/>Wɔwɔ ɔhene a ɔdi wɔn so, a ɔno ne ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔhwɛ bunu no so. Ne din wɔ Hebri kasa mu de “Abadon” ɛnna Hela kasa mu nso, ɛde “Apolion”, a nʼasekyerɛ ne “Ɔsɛefoɔ.”<verse eid="REV 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12"/>Ɔhaw baako atwam. Yei akyi, ɔhaw mmienu bi bɛba.<verse eid="REV 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahohommɔne Ɛnan No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13"/>Afei ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtɔ so nsia no hyɛnee ne totorobɛnto. Metee nne bi firii sikakɔkɔɔ afɔrebukyia a ɛsi Onyankopɔn anim no ntweaso nyinaa. <verse eid="REV 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14"/>Nne no ka kyerɛɛ ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtɔ so nsia a ɔkura totorobɛnto no sɛ, “Sanesane abɔfoɔ baanan a wɔasesa wɔn, Asubɔnten Eufrate ho no.” <verse eid="REV 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15"/>Wɔsanesanee abɔfoɔ baanan no. Wɔasiesie wɔn ama saa dɔnhwereɛ yi, saa da yi, saa bosome yi ne saa afeɛ yi sɛ wɔnkunkum adasamma mu nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu baako. <verse eid="REV 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16"/>Wɔdii akodɔm ɔpepem ahanu anim. Wɔbɔɔ wɔn dodoɔ no ho amaneɛ maa meteeɛ.<verse eid="REV 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17"/>Na mʼanisoadehunu no mu no, mehunuu apɔnkɔ no ne wɔn kafoɔ. Na wɔn nkataboɔ no yɛ kɔɔ sɛ ogya, tumm sɛ afasebire, ɛnna akokɔsradeɛ sɛ sɔfe. Na ɔpɔnkɔ no ti te sɛ gyata ti a ogya wisie ne sɔfe firi wɔn anom. <verse eid="REV 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18"/>Saa ɔhaw ahodoɔ mmiɛnsa no a ɛyɛ ogya, wisie ne sɔfe no a ɛfiri apɔnkɔ no anom baeɛ no kumm adasamma nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu baako. <verse eid="REV 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, na apɔnkɔ no tumi nyinaa firi wɔn anom ne wɔn dua. Wɔn dua te sɛ awɔ a wɔwɔ ti a ɛno na na wɔde pira nnipa.<verse eid="REV 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20"/>Adasamma a wɔkaeɛ no a ɔhaw no ankum wɔn no annu wɔn ho amfiri wɔn nsa ano nnwuma ho. Wɔannyae ahonhommɔne ne ahoni ne sika ne dwetɛ ne ayowaa ne aboɔ ne nnua a ɛnhunu adeɛ na ɛnte asɛm na ɛntumi nnante no som. <verse eid="REV 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21"/>Saa ara nso na wɔannu wɔn ho amfiri wɔn awudie ne wɔn adutoɔ ne wɔn adwamammɔ ne wɔn korɔno ho.<verse eid="REV 9:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Nhyehyɛeɛ Aba Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1"/>Afei, mehunuu ɔbɔfoɔ hoɔdenfoɔ foforɔ bi a ɔfiri ɔsoro resiane ba fam. Na ɔhyɛ omununkum mu a nyankontɔn bɔ ne ti. Na nʼanim te sɛ owia, na ne nan te sɛ ogya fadum. <verse eid="REV 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2"/>Na nwoma ketewaa bi kura no a wabue mu. Ɔde ne nan nifa sii ɛpo so na benkum no si asase so. <verse eid="REV 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3"/>Ɔde nne kɛseɛ teaam sɛdeɛ gyata bobom. Ɔteaam no, aprannaa nson kasaeɛ. <verse eid="REV 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4"/>Wɔkasaeɛ pɛ, na mepɛ sɛ metwerɛ. Nanso, metee nne bi firii ɔsoro a ɛkaa sɛ, “Ma nsɛm a aprannaa nson no kaeɛ no nka wo tirim. Ntwerɛ!”<verse eid="REV 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5"/>Ɛhɔ ara ɔbɔfoɔ a mehunuu sɛ ɔgyina hɔ a ne nan baako si ɛpo so na baako si asase so no maa ne nsa nifa so kɔɔ soro, <verse eid="REV 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6"/>na ɔde Onyankopɔn a ɔte hɔ daa daa a ɔbɔɔ ɔsoro ne asase ne ɛpo ne deɛ ɛwɔ mu nyinaa no edin kaa ntam. Ɔbɔfoɔ no kaa sɛ, “Ɛberɛ sɛeɛ biara nni hɔ. <verse eid="REV 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7"/>Na sɛ ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtɔ so nson no hyɛne ne totorobɛnto no a ansa na Onyankopɔn bɛwie nʼahintasɛm mu nhyehyɛeɛ no, sɛdeɛ ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasomfoɔ a wɔyɛ adiyifoɔ no.”<verse eid="REV 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8"/>Afei, nne a metee sɛ ɛfiri ɔsoro no kasa kyerɛɛ me bio sɛ. “Kɔ na kɔgye nwoma a wabue mu a ɛkura ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔgyina ɛpo ne asase so no.”<verse eid="REV 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9"/>Mekɔɔ ɔbɔfoɔ no nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ ɔmfa nwoma ketewa no mma me. Ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Gye na kɔwe. Ɛbɛkeka wɔ wo yam, nanso wʼanomu deɛ, ɛbɛyɛ dɛ te sɛ ɛwoɔ.” <verse eid="REV 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10"/>Megyee nwoma ketewa no firii ne nsam weeɛ, na ɛyɛɛ dɛ te sɛ ɛwoɔ wɔ mʼanom. Nanso, memeneeɛ no akyi, ɛmaa me yam kaa me. <verse eid="REV 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11"/>Afei, wɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Kɔ so ka deɛ ɛbɛba kyerɛ aman bebree sofoɔ, kasa ahodoɔ ne ahemfo nso.”<verse eid="REV 10:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Adansefoɔ Baanu No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1"/>Wɔmaa me susudua bi a ɛte sɛ poma, na wɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Sɔre na susu Onyankopɔn asɔredan no ne afɔrebukyia no na kan wɔn a wɔresom wɔ asɔredan no mu no. <verse eid="REV 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2"/>Nanso, mfa asɔredan no adihɔ nka ho, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔde hɔ ama amanamanmufoɔ, na wɔbɛtiatia kuro kronkron no so abosome aduanan mmienu. <verse eid="REV 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3"/>Mɛsoma mʼadansefoɔ baanu a wɔfirafira ayitoma, na wɔaka Onyankopɔn asɛm saa nna apem ahanu ne aduosia no mu.” <verse eid="REV 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4"/>Saa adansefoɔ baanu no ne ngo dua mmienu no ne nkaneadua mmienu a ɛsi asase a ɛwɔ Awurade anim no so no. <verse eid="REV 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5"/>Egya firi wɔn anom bɛkunkum atamfoɔ biara a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔha wɔn no. Ɛno enti, obiara a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔha wɔn no, wɔbɛkum no. <verse eid="REV 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6"/>Wɔwɔ tumi sɛ ɛberɛ a wɔreka Onyankopɔn asɛm no, wɔto soro mu, a osuo rentɔ. Wɔwɔ tumi sɛ wɔde ɔhaw bɛto asase so mpɛn dodoɔ biara a wɔpɛ.<verse eid="REV 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7"/>Na sɛ wɔka wɔn asɛm no wie a, aboa a ɔbɛfiri bunu no mu apue no ne wɔn bɛko. Ɔbɛdi wɔn so akum wɔn <verse eid="REV 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8"/>na wɔn amu no agu kuro kɛseɛ no abɔntene so, wɔ baabi a wɔbɔɔ wɔn Awurade nnadewa mu wɔ asɛnnua no so a ɛhɔ din pa de Sodom ne Misraim no. <verse eid="REV 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9"/>Na nnipa a wɔfiri aman so ne mmusuakuo ne kasa ahodoɔ ne aman bi so bɛhwɛ wɔn afunu nnansa ne fa, na wɔremma ɛkwan mma wɔnsie wɔn. <verse eid="REV 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10"/>Asase so nnipa ani bɛgye sɛ saa nnipa baanu no awuwu. Wɔbɛgye wɔn ani na wɔakyɛ wɔn ho akyɛdeɛ ɛfiri sɛ, saa adiyifoɔ baanu no na wɔde ɔhaw bɛtoo asase sofoɔ so.<verse eid="REV 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11"/>Nanso, nnansa akyi no, Honhom a ɔfiri Onyankopɔn hɔ bɛwura wɔn mu na wɔasɔre. Na ehu kɛseɛ bɛka obiara a ɔbɛhunu. <verse eid="REV 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12"/>Afei, nne a ano yɛ den firi ɔsoro bɛka sɛ, “Mommra ɔsoro ha.” Na ɛberɛ a wɔn atamfoɔ rehwɛ wɔn no, wɔnam omununkum mu kɔɔ ɔsoro.<verse eid="REV 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13"/>Saa ɛberɛ korɔ no ara mu, asase wosoo dendeenden. Kuro no nkyɛmu edu mu baako sɛeɛ, na nnipa mpemnson wuwuiɛ wɔ asasewosoɔ no mu. Nnipa a wɔaka no bɔɔ hu na wɔkamfoo Onyankopɔn a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no kɛseyɛ.<verse eid="REV 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14"/>Ɔhaw a ɛtɔ so mmienu no atwa, nanso hwɛ, ɛrenkyɛre na ɔhaw a ɛtɔ so mmiɛnsa aba.<verse eid="REV 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Totorobɛnto A Ɛtɔ So Nson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15"/>Afei, ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtɔ so nson hyɛnee ne totorobɛnto, na nne denden wɔ ɔsoro kaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">“Tumi a wɔde di ewiase so seesei no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">yɛ yɛn Awurade ne ne Kristo no dea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">na ɔbɛdi ɔhene daa daa.”<verse eid="REV 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16"/>Afei, mpanimfoɔ aduonu ɛnan a wɔte wɔn ahennwa so Onyankopɔn anim no de wɔn anim butubutu fam, somm Onyankopɔn, <verse eid="REV 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17"/>kaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">“Yɛda wo ase, Otumfoɔ Onyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">wo a wowɔ hɔ na wowɔ hɔ dada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">sɛ woafa wo tumi kɛseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">na wahyɛ aseɛ redi ɔhene.<verse eid="REV 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18"/>Amanaman no bo fuiɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ɛfiri sɛ wʼabofuo berɛ no aduru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔbu awufoɔ atɛn.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">Ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ wobɔ wo nkoa adiyifoɔ no aba so</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">ne wo nkurɔfoɔ a wɔdi wo din ni no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">akɛseɛ ne nketewa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ɛberɛ aduru sɛ wosɛe wɔn a wɔsɛee asase no!”<verse eid="REV 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19"/>Onyankopɔn asɔredan a ɛwɔ ɔsoro no bueɛ maa wɔhunuu adaka a apam no wɔ mu no wɔ asɔredan no mu. Afei, anyinam ne aprannaa paapaee, ɛnna asase wosoeɛ na asukɔtweaa bebree nso tɔeɛ.<verse eid="REV 11:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbaa No Ne Ɔtweaseɛ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1"/>Afei, nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ kɛseɛ bi daa ne ho adi wɔ ɔsoro. Ɔbaa bi, na nʼatadeɛ yɛ owia a ɔsrane wɔ ne nan ase, na nsoromma dumienu ahenkyɛ hyɛ no. <verse eid="REV 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2"/>Na ɔnyem a ɔrebɛwo, na awoyea enti, na ɔresu. <verse eid="REV 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3"/>Nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ kɛseɛ foforɔ bi daa ne ho adi wɔ ɔsoro. Ɔwɔ kɔkɔɔ kakraka bi, na ne ti yɛ nson na ɔwɔ mmɛn edu a ahenkyɛ hyehyɛ ebiara so. <verse eid="REV 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4"/>Ɔde ne dua twee nsoromma a ɛwɔ ɔsoro no mu nkyɛmu mmiɛnsa mu baako too wɔn guu fam. Ɔgyinaa ɔbaa a ɔrewo no anim, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a ɔwo ɔba no to hɔ ara pɛ, ɔbɛfa abɔfra no awe. <verse eid="REV 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5"/>Afei, ɔbaa no woo abarimaa a ɔde nsa a ɛyɛ den bɛdi aman nyinaa so. Nanso, wɔhwim abɔfra no kɔɔ Onyankopɔn ne nʼahennwa ho. <verse eid="REV 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6"/>Ɔbaa no dwane kɔɔ ɛserɛ so baabi a Onyankopɔn asiesie ama no a wɔbɛhwɛ no yie wɔ nnafua apem ahanu ne aduosia mu.<verse eid="REV 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7"/>Afei, ɔko sii ɔsoro hɔ. Mikael ne nʼabɔfoɔ ko tiaa ɔwɔ no, ɛnna ɔno nso ne nʼabɔfoɔ ko tiaeɛ. <verse eid="REV 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8"/>Nanso, wɔdii ɔwɔ no so nkonim na wɔamma ɔne nʼabɔfoɔ antena ɔsoro bio. <verse eid="REV 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9"/>Wɔtoo ɔwɔ kakraka no tweneeɛ. Ɔno ne ɔwɔ dada no a wɔfrɛ no ɔbonsam a ɔdaadaa ewiase nyinaa no. Wɔtoo ɔno ne nʼabɔfoɔ nyinaa guu asase so.<verse eid="REV 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10"/>Afei, metee nne denden bi wɔ ɔsoro a ɛka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">“Afei, na Onyankopɔn nkwagyeɛ aba!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">Afei, na Onyankopɔn akyerɛ ne tumi sɛ ɔyɛ Ɔhene!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">Afei, na nʼAgyenkwa no akyerɛ ne tumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">ɛfiri sɛ, yɛn nuanom no ahohorabɔni a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">ɔgyinaa Onyankopɔn anim bɔɔ wɔn ahohora awia ne anadwo no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">wɔapam no afiri soro no.<verse eid="REV 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11"/>Yɛn nuanom no nam Odwammaa no mogya so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">ne nokorɛ a ɔdaa no adi so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">dii ne so nkonim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">Na wɔasiesie wɔn ho sɛ wɔde wɔn nkwa bɛto hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">na wɔawuwu.<verse eid="REV 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12"/>Enti, mo ɔsoro ne mo a motete hɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">momma mo ani nnye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Afei, asase ne ɛpo nnue!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">Ɛfiri sɛ, ɔbonsam no atoa mo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Na ne bo afu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">ɛfiri sɛ, ɔnim sɛ ne ɛberɛ a aka sua.”<verse eid="REV 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔwɔ no hunuu sɛ wɔato no atwene asase so no, ɔtaa ɔbaa a wawo abarimaa no. <verse eid="REV 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14"/>Wɔmaa ɔbaa no ɔkɔdeɛ ntaban akɛseɛ mmienu, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a ɔbɛtumi atu akɔ baabi a wɔasiesie ama no wɔ ɛserɛ so hɔ a wɔbɛhwɛ no mfeɛ mmiɛnsa ne fa sɛdeɛ ɔwɔ no renni nʼakyi bio. <verse eid="REV 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15"/>Afei, ɔwɔ no puu nsuo te sɛ asubɔnten dii ɔbaa no akyi sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ɛbɛfa no. <verse eid="REV 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16"/>Nanso, asase boaa ɔbaa no. Ɛbuee nʼanom nom nsuo a ɔwɔ no pu guu hɔ no nyinaa. <verse eid="REV 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17"/>Ɔwɔ no bo fuu ɔbaa no, enti ɔkɔeɛ de ntɔkwa kɔkaa ɔbaa no asefoɔ a wɔaka a ɛyɛ wɔn a wɔdi Onyankopɔn mmara so na wɔgye nokorɛ a Yesu ada no adi no di. <verse eid="REV 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18"/>Na ɔwɔ no kɔgyinaa mpoano hɔ.<verse eid="REV 12:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Mmoa Mmienu Bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1"/>Afei, mehunuu sɛ aboa bi apue ɛpo no mu reba. Na ɔwɔ mmɛn edu ne tire nson a na ahenkyɛ hyehyɛ mmɛn no biara so na edin a ɛgu Onyankopɔn ho fi bobɔ etire no ho. <verse eid="REV 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2"/>Aboa a mehunuu no no, na ɔte sɛ ɔsebɔ a ne nan te sɛ sisi, na nʼano nso te sɛ gyata. Ɔtweaseɛ no de ɔno ankasa ahoɔden ne nʼahennwa ne ne tumi nyinaa maa aboa no. <verse eid="REV 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3"/>Mehunuu sɛ wɔapira ne tiri no baako a ayɛ sɛ wɔrentumi nkum kuro no, nanso na kuro no awu. Aboa no ho yɛɛ ewiasefoɔ nyinaa nwanwa, enti wɔtu dii nʼakyi. <verse eid="REV 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4"/>Nnipa nyinaa somm ɔtweaseɛ no, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔde ne tumi nyinaa ama aboa no. Wɔsomm aboa no nso kaa sɛ, “Hwan na ɔte sɛ aboa no? Na hwan na ɔbɛtumi ne no ako?”<verse eid="REV 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5"/>Wɔmaa aboa no kwan maa ɔkaa abususɛm akɛseakɛseɛ tiaa Onyankopɔn, na wɔmaa no tumi sɛ ɔnyɛ deɛ ɔpɛ biara abosome aduanan mmienu. <verse eid="REV 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6"/>Ɔhyɛɛ aseɛ domee Onyankopɔn, ne din, baabi a ɔte ne wɔn a wɔte ɔsoro nyinaa. <verse eid="REV 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7"/>Wɔmaa no ɛkwan ma ɔne Onyankopɔn nkurɔfoɔ koeɛ sɛ ɔbɛdi wɔn so. Na wɔmaa no aman ne mmusuakuo ne nkurɔfoɔ ne kasa nyinaa mu so tumi. <verse eid="REV 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8"/>Nnipa a wɔte asase so nyinaa bɛsom no: obiara a wantwerɛ ne din anhyɛ ateasefoɔ nwoma a ɛwɔ Odwammaa a wɔkumm no no mu ansa na wɔrebɔ ewiase.<verse eid="REV 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9"/>“Tie, wo a wowɔ aso, bɛtie.<verse eid="REV 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10"/>“Obiara a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkyere no no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">wɔbɛkyere no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">Obiara a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkum no akofena ano no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">wɔbɛkum no.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 13:10">Yei mu boasetɔ ne gyidie ho hia Onyankopɔn nkurɔfoɔ.<verse eid="REV 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11"/>Afei, mehunuu aboa foforɔ a ɔrepue afiri asase mu. Na ɔwɔ mmɛn mmienu te sɛ nnwammaa, nanso na ɔkasa te sɛ ɔtweaseɛ no. <verse eid="REV 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12"/>Ɔsii aboa a ɔdi ɛkan no ananmu de ne tumi kɛseɛ no dii dwuma, na ɔhyɛɛ asase ne ɛso nnipa sɛ wɔnsom deɛ nʼapirakuro no awu no. <verse eid="REV 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13"/>Aboa a ɔtɔ so mmienu yi yɛɛ anwanwadeɛ akɛseɛ bebree. Ɔmaa ogya firi ɔsoro baa asase so wɔ nnipa nyinaa anim. <verse eid="REV 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14"/>Na ɔnam anwanwadeɛ a wɔmaa no ho ɛkwan yɛeɛ wɔ aboa a ɔdi ɛkan no anim no so daadaa nnipa a wɔte asase so nyinaa. Aboa no ka kyerɛɛ ewiase nnipa nyinaa sɛ, wɔnsi ohoni mfa nhyɛ aboa a wɔde akofena piraa no nanso nʼapirakuro no awu na ɔte ase no animuonyam. <verse eid="REV 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15"/>Wɔmaa aboa a ɔtɔ so mmienu no ɛkwan ma ɔhomee nkwa guu aboa a ɔdi ɛkan ohoni no mu, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a ohoni no bɛtumi akasa, na wakum obiara a ɔnsom no no. <verse eid="REV 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16"/>Aboa no hyɛɛ nnipa nyinaa, nketewa ne akɛseɛ; adefoɔ ne ahiafoɔ, nkoa ne wɔn a wɔde wɔn ho sɛ wɔnhyɛ wɔn nsa nifa ho ne wɔn moma so agyiraeɛ. <verse eid="REV 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17"/>Obiara nni ho ɛkwan sɛ ɔtɔ anaa ɔtɔn, gye sɛ wɔde aboa no din anaa nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a ɛgyina hɔ ma edin no hyɛ ne ho agyiraeɛ.<verse eid="REV 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18"/>Yei hia ma nyansa. Obiara a ɔnim nyansa no bɛtumi ahunu nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a ɛgyina hɔ ma aboa no ase, ɛfiri sɛ, nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ no gyina hɔ ma onipa edin. Ne nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ yɛ ahansia aduosia nsia.<verse eid="REV 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɛdwom Foforɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1"/>Afei, mehwɛeɛ na mehunuu sɛ Odwammaa no gyina Sion bepɔ so. Na nnipa ɔpeha aduanan ɛnan ka ne ho a wɔatwerɛ ne din ne nʼAgya din wɔ wɔn moma so. <verse eid="REV 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2"/>Na metee nne bi firi ɔsoro a na ɛworo so te sɛ nsuworoeɛ a ano yɛ den, na ɛte sɛ aprannaa. Ɛnne a meteeɛ no te sɛ dwom a sankubɔfoɔ bi rebɔ wɔ ne sankuo so. <verse eid="REV 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3"/>Wɔtoo dwom foforɔ bi wɔ ahennwa no ne ateasefoɔ baanan no ne mpanimfoɔ no anim. Nnipa ɔpeha aduanan ɛnan a wɔagye wɔn afiri asase so no nko ara na wɔtumi suaeɛ. <verse eid="REV 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4"/>Wɔyɛ mmarima bi a wɔamfa mmaa angu wɔn ho fi, na wɔyɛ mmabunu. Baabiara a Odwammaa no bɛkɔ no na wɔdi nʼakyi. Wɔagye wɔn nkwa afiri nnipa mu na wɔne nnipa a wɔdi ɛkan a wɔde wɔn ama Onyankopɔn ne Odwammaa no. <verse eid="REV 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5"/>Wɔnka atorɔsɛm, na mfomsoɔ nni wɔn ho.<verse eid="REV 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abɔfoɔ Baasa No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6"/>Afei mehunuu ɔbɔfoɔ foforɔ sɛ watu nam ɔsorosoro a ɔrekɔka Asɛmpa a ɛntwam da no akyerɛ asase so nnipa a aman ne mmusuakuo ne kasa ne nkurɔfoɔ nyinaa ka ho. <verse eid="REV 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7"/>Ɔteaam sɛ, “Monsuro Onyankopɔn na monkamfo ne kɛseyɛ. Ɛfiri sɛ, ɛberɛ no aduru sɛ ɔbu adasamma atɛn. Monsom deɛ ɔbɔɔ ɔsoro, asase, ɛpo ne nsutire no!”<verse eid="REV 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtɔ so mmienu dii deɛ ɔdi ɛkan no akyi kaa sɛ. “Wahwe ase! Babilonia kɛseɛ ahwe ase! Ɛfiri sɛ, wama amanaman nyinaa anom nʼadwamammɔ nsã no bi.”<verse eid="REV 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtɔ so mmiɛnsa a ɔdi baanu a wɔdi ɛkan no akyi teaam kaa sɛ, “Obiara a ɔsom aboa no ne ne sɛso ohoni a na ɔma wɔhyɛ ne nsa ho anaa ne moma so agyiraeɛ <verse eid="REV 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10"/>no ankasa bɛnom Onyankopɔn nsã, nʼabufuo nsã a ɔde nʼahoɔden nyinaa ahwie agu nʼabufuo kuruwa mu no. Wɔn a wɔbɛyɛ saa no nyinaa, wɔbɛhyɛ wɔn ahoyera wɔ ogya ne sɔfe mu wɔ abɔfoɔ ne Odwammaa no anim. <verse eid="REV 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11"/>Na ogya no wisie a ɛhyɛ wɔn ahoyera no kɔ ɔsoro daa daa. Awia ne anadwo, ahomegyeɛ nni hɔ ma wɔn a wɔsom aboa no ne ne sɛso ohoni ne obiara a wɔde ne din ahyɛ no agyiraeɛ no.” <verse eid="REV 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12"/>Yei enti na ɛsɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn nkurɔfoɔ ne wɔn a wɔdi Onyankopɔn mmara so, na wɔgye Yesu di no nya boasetɔ no.<verse eid="REV 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13"/>Afei, metee nne bi firi ɔsoro a ɛkaa sɛ, “Twerɛ yei. Nhyira ne awufoɔ a wɔwu Awurade mu firi seesei rekɔ yi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">Honhom no se, “Aane, wɔbɛhome afiri wɔn brɛ no mu; na wɔn nnwuma di wɔn akyi.”<verse eid="REV 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14"/>Mehunuu omununkum fitaa bi na obi a ɔte sɛ Onipa Ba a sikakɔkɔɔ ahenkyɛ hyɛ no na ɔkura kantankrankyi nnamnnam bi wɔ ne nsam. <verse eid="REV 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15"/>Afei, ɔbɔfoɔ foforɔ bi firii asɔredan no mu pueeɛ, teaam kyerɛɛ deɛ ɔte omununkum no so no sɛ, “Fa wo kantankrankyi no twa ɛfiri sɛ otwaberɛ no aduru, asase no aso aba a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtwa!” <verse eid="REV 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16"/>Enti, deɛ ɔte omununkum so no hwim ne kantankrankyi asase so maa ɛtwaa asase so nnɔbaeɛ.<verse eid="REV 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17"/>Afei, mehunuu ɔbɔfoɔ foforɔ bi a ɔfiri ɔsoro asɔredan mu apue a ɔno nso kura kantankrankyi nnamnnam bi. <verse eid="REV 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ foforɔ bi a ɔno nso hwɛ ogya no firi afɔrebukyia no mu pueeɛ. Ɔteaa ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔkura kantankrankyi nnamnnam no sɛ, “Fa wo kantankrankyi nnamnnam no twa asase so bobe no esia esia ɛfiri sɛ, nʼaba no abere.” <verse eid="REV 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19"/>Enti, ɔbɔfoɔ no hwim ne kantankrankyi no wɔ asase so de twitwaa bobe aba no na ɔde kɔguu Onyankopɔn abufuo nsakyiamena kɛseɛ no mu. <verse eid="REV 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20"/>Wɔtiatiaa bobe no so wɔ nsakyiamena a ɛwɔ kuropɔn no mfikyire, na mogya firii bobe no mu teneeɛ sɛ asubɔnten akwansini ahaanu a emu dɔ nso bɛyɛ anammɔn enum.<verse eid="REV 14:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔyaredɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1"/>Mehunuu ade foforɔ bi a ɛso na ɛyɛ nwanwa wɔ ɔsoro. Na wɔyɛ abɔfoɔ baason a wɔkura ɔhaw nson a ɛno ne ɔhaw a ɛtwa toɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛno na ɛkyerɛ Onyankopɔn abufuo a ɛtwa toɔ. <verse eid="REV 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2"/>Afei, mehunuu biribi te sɛ ahwehwɛ ɛpo a wɔde ogya afra. Afei, mehunuu wɔn a wɔadi aboa no ne ne sɛso ohoni ne deɛ wɔde agyiraeɛ asi ne din anan mu no so nkonim. Na wɔgyinagyina ahwehwɛ ɛpo no ho a wɔkurakura asankuo a Onyankopɔn de ama wɔn no. <verse eid="REV 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3"/>Na wɔreto Onyankopɔn akoa Mose dwom ne Odwammaa no dwom sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">“Awurade, Otumfoɔ Onyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">wo nnwuma yɛ akɛseɛ na ɛyɛ nwanwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Amansanhene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Wʼakwan tene na ɛyɛ nokorɛ.<verse eid="REV 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4"/>Hwan na ɔnsuro wo, Awurade?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Hwan na ɔrenka wo kɛseyɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Wo nko na woyɛ kronkron.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Aman nyinaa bɛba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">abɛsom wɔ wʼanim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">ɛfiri sɛ, obiara ahunu wo tenenee nnwuma no.”<verse eid="REV 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5"/>Afei mehunuu sɛ asɔredan a ɛwɔ ɔsoro hɔ no Kronkron mu Kronkron no abue a adanseɛ ntomadan si mu. <verse eid="REV 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6"/>Abɔfoɔ baason a wɔmaa wɔn tumi sɛ wɔmfa ɔhaw nson mmra no pue firii asɔredan no mu, a wɔhyehyɛ ntadeɛ fitafitaa a wɔbobɔ sikakɔkɔɔ abɔsoɔ wɔ wɔn koko so. <verse eid="REV 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7"/>Afei, ateasefoɔ baanan no mu baako maa abɔfoɔ baason no sikakɔkɔɔ nkuruwa nson a Onyankopɔn a ɔte ase daa daa no abufuo ahyɛ no ma. <verse eid="REV 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8"/>Wisie a ɛfiri Onyankopɔn animuonyam ne ne tumi mu no hyɛɛ asɔredan no ma. Na obiara antumi ankɔ asɔredan no mu kɔsii sɛ ɔhaw nson a abɔfoɔ baason no de baeɛ no to twaeɛ.<verse eid="REV 15:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Abufuo Nson No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1"/>Afei, metee nne bi sɛ ɛrekasa firi asɔredan mu hɔ kyerɛ abɔfoɔ no sɛ, “Mo nkɔ nkɔhwie Onyankopɔn abufuo nson a ɛwɔ nkuruwa nson mu no ngu asase so.”<verse eid="REV 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔdi ɛkan no kɔhwiee ne kuruwa no mu abufuo guu asase so. Akuro a ɛyɛ hu na ɛyɛ yea tutuu wɔn a wɔde aboa no ahyɛ wɔn ho agyiraeɛ no ne wɔn a wɔsom ne sɛso ohoni no nso.<verse eid="REV 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtɔ so mmienu no hwiee ne kuruwa no mu abufuo guu ɛpo mu. Nsuo no danee sɛ owufoɔ mogya, na abɔdeɛ biara a nkwa wɔ mu wɔ ɛpo no mu no wuiɛ.<verse eid="REV 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtɔ so mmiɛnsa no hwiee ne kuruwa no mu abufuo guu nsubɔntene ne nsuwa mu maa ne nyinaa danee mogya. <verse eid="REV 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5"/>Metee sɛ ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔhwɛ nsuo so no reka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">“wʼatɛn a wobuo no yɛ atɛntenenee.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">Ɔkronkronni a wowɔ hɔ na wowɔ ha dada,<verse eid="REV 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6"/>ɛfiri sɛ wahwie mo ahotefoɔ ne adiyifoɔ mogya agu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">woama wɔn mogya sɛ wɔnnom, sɛdeɛ ɛfata wɔn.”<verse eid="REV 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7"/>Afei, metee nne bi wɔ afɔrebukyia no so sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">“Aane, Awurade, Otumfoɔ Onyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">atɛn a wobu nyinaa yɛ atɛntenenee!”<verse eid="REV 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtɔ so ɛnan no hwiee ne kuruwa no mu abufuo guu owia so na wɔmaa no tumi sɛ ɔnhye nnipa. <verse eid="REV 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9"/>Owia hyeɛ no anoden maa nnipa domee Onyankopɔn a ɔwɔ saa ɔhaw yi nyinaa so tumi no din. Nanso, wɔannu wɔn ho anhyɛ Onyankopɔn animuonyam.<verse eid="REV 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10"/>Afei, ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtɔ so enum no hwiee ne kuruwa no mu abufuo guu aboa no ahennwa no so. Esum duruu aboa no ahemman mu, na ɛsiane yea enti, nnipa wee wɔn tɛkrɛma; <verse eid="REV 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11"/>na ɛsiane saa yea no ne akuro a ɛtutuu wɔn no enti, wɔdomee ɔsoro Onyankopɔn. Nanso, wɔantwe wɔn ho amfiri wɔn bɔne ho.<verse eid="REV 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtɔ so nsia no hwiee ne kuruwa no mu abufuo guu Asubɔnten Eufrate mu. Asuo no weweeɛ, danee ɛkwan maa ahene a wɔfiri apueeɛ. <verse eid="REV 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13"/>Afei, mehunuu ahonhommɔne mmiɛnsa bi a na wɔte sɛ mponkyerɛne a na wɔfifiri ɔtweaseɛ no ne aboa no ne atorɔ odiyifoɔ no anom. <verse eid="REV 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14"/>Wɔyɛ ahonhommɔne a wɔyɛ anwanwadeɛ. Saa ahonhom mmiɛnsa yi kɔ ahene a wɔwɔ asase so nyinaa nkyɛn kɔka wɔn nyinaa boa ano ma Otumfoɔ Onyankopɔn ɔko da kɛseɛ no.<verse eid="REV 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Montie! Mereba te sɛ ɔkorɔmfoɔ. Nhyira ne deɛ ɔwɛn na ɔhwɛ ne ntadeɛ so, sɛdeɛ ɔrennante adagya ngu ne ho anim ase wɔ badwam!”</char><verse eid="REV 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16"/>Ahonhom no boaa ahene no ano wɔ baabi a Hebri kasa mu wɔfrɛ hɔ Armagedon.<verse eid="REV 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17"/>Afei, ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔtɔ so nson no hwiee ne kuruwa no mu abufuo guu mframa mu. Nne denden bi firi ahennwa a ɛwɔ asɔredan no mu no kaa sɛ, “Wɔawie.” <verse eid="REV 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18"/>Na anyinam tete maa aprannaa paapaeɛ, ɛnna asasewosoɔ denden bi baeɛ. Ɛfirii sɛ wɔbɔɔ onipa no, asasewosoɔ biara mmaa saa da. Yei ne asasewosoɔ nyinaa mu deɛ ano yɛ den pa ara. <verse eid="REV 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19"/>Kuro kɛseɛ no mu paee mmiɛnsa, na aman nyinaa nkuro akɛseɛ sɛesɛeɛ. Onyankopɔn kaee Babilonia kɛseɛ no, na ɔmaa no nsã a ano yɛ den a ɛyɛ nʼabufuo firi ne kuruwa ano nomeɛ. <verse eid="REV 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20"/>Nsupɔ ne mmepɔ nyinaa yeraeɛ. <verse eid="REV 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21"/>Asukɔtweaa kɛseɛ a ebiara mu duru yɛ kilogram aduonum tɔ firii soro guu nnipa so. Na ɛsiane asukɔtweaa no haw a na ɛyɛ hu no enti, nnipa domee Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="REV 16:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Odwamanfoɔ Bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1"/>Abɔfoɔ baason no mu baako a ɔkura nkuruwa nson no baa me nkyɛn bɛkaa sɛ, “Bra na menkyerɛ wo kwan a wɔbɛfa so atwe odwamanfoɔ kɛseɛ a ɔte nsuo pii so no aso. <verse eid="REV 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2"/>Ewiase ahene ne no bɔɔ adwaman, na asase so nnipa aboto wɔ nʼadwaman nsã no mu.”<verse eid="REV 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3"/>Honhom no faa me maa ɔbɔfoɔ no de me kɔɔ ɛserɛ so. Ɛhɔ na mehunuu ɔbaa bi sɛ ɔte aboa kɔkɔɔ bi a wɔatwerɛ edin a ɛyɛ abususɛm agu ne ho nyinaa. Na aboa no wɔ tire nson, ne mmɛn edu. <verse eid="REV 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4"/>Na ɔbaa no hyɛ atadeɛ afasebire ne kɔkɔɔ a ɔde sikakɔkɔɔ aboɔ ne nhweneɛ a ne boɔ yɛ den ahyehyɛ ne ho. Na ɔkura sika kuruwa a afideɛ ne adwamammɔ ho nneɛma ayɛ no ma tɔ. <verse eid="REV 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5"/>Na wɔatwerɛ edin bi wɔ ne moma so a ne nkyerɛaseɛ no wɔ ahintasɛm mu sɛ,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">“Babilonia kɛseɛ</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">asase so adwamanfoɔ</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">ne akyiwadeɛ maame.”<verse eid="REV 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6"/>Na mehunuu sɛ Onyankopɔn nkurɔfoɔ ne Yesu akyidifoɔ a wɔkumm wɔn no mogya aboro no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Mehunuu no no, ɛyɛɛ me nwanwa. <verse eid="REV 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ no bisaa me sɛ, “Adɛn enti na ɛyɛ wo nwanwa? Mɛkyerɛ wo ahintasɛm nkyerɛaseɛ a ɛwɔ ɔbaa no ne aboa no a ɔwɔ tire nson ne mmɛn edu a ɔte ne so no ho. <verse eid="REV 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8"/>Aboa a wohunuu no no na ɔte ase, nanso ɔnte ase bio. Ɔrebɛfiri bunu no mu aba ama wɔasɛe no. Nnipa a wɔte asase so a wɔantwerɛ wɔn din angu ateasefoɔ nwoma no mu ansa na wɔrebɔ ewiase no, sɛ wɔhunu aboa no a, ɛbɛyɛ wɔn nwanwa. Ɛberɛ bi na ɔte ase, nanso seesei ɔnte ase na ɔbɛsane aba.<verse eid="REV 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9"/>“Nyansa ne nteaseɛ ho hia wɔ ha. Etire nson no gyina hɔ ma mmepɔ nson, mmepɔ a ɔbaa no tena so. Wɔyɛ ahene baason nso <verse eid="REV 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10"/>a wɔn mu baanum awuwu, na wɔn mu baako da so di ɔhene na ɔbaako a ɔka wɔn ho no mmaeɛ. Na sɛ ɔba a ɔbɛdi ɔhene kakra. <verse eid="REV 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11"/>Aboa no a anka na ɔte ase na afei deɛ, ɔnte ase no yɛ ɔhene a ɔtɔ so nwɔtwe a ɔka baason a wɔdi ɛkan no ho a ɔrekɔ ne sɛeɛ mu.<verse eid="REV 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12"/>“Mmɛn edu a wohunuiɛ no yɛ ahene edu a wɔmfirii wɔn ahennie ase a wɔbɛma wɔn tumi na wɔne aboa no adi ɔhene dɔnhwereɛ no. <verse eid="REV 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13"/>Wɔn nyinaa wɔ botaeɛ baako, na wɔde wɔn ahoɔden ne wɔn tumi bɛma aboa no. <verse eid="REV 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14"/>Wɔbɛko atia Odwammaa no, na ɔno ne nʼakyidifoɔ, agyidifoɔ ne nokwafoɔ a wɔafrɛ wɔn no bɛdi wɔn so, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔyɛ awuranom mu Awurade ne ahene mu Ɔhene.”<verse eid="REV 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ no nso ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Nsuo a wohunuiɛ a odwamanfoɔ no te so no yɛ nkuro ne nkurɔfoɔ akuakuo ne aman ne kasa hodoɔ. <verse eid="REV 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16"/>Mmɛn edu ne aboa no a wohunuiɛ no bɛkyiri odwamanfoɔ no. Wɔbɛfa biribiara a ɛwɔ ne ho ama wada adagya. Wɔbɛwe ne nam na wɔde ogya ahye no. <verse eid="REV 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn de ahyɛ wɔn akoma mu sɛ wɔbɛpene so de wɔn tumi ama aboa no na wadi ɔhene kɔsi sɛ Onyankopɔn asɛm no bɛba mu de ahyɛ ne botaeɛ no ma. <verse eid="REV 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18"/>Ɔbaa a wohunuu no no yɛ kuro kɛseɛ a ɛdi asase so ahene so.”<verse eid="REV 17:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Babilonia Asehweɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1"/>Yei akyi, mehunuu ɔbɔfoɔ foforɔ sɛ ɔfiri ɔsoro reba fam. Na ɔwɔ tumi kɛseɛ na nʼanimuonyam hyerɛn asase so nyinaa. <verse eid="REV 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2"/>Ɔteaam dendeenden sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">“ ‘Wahwe ase! Babilonia kɛseɛ ahwe ase!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">Adane ahonhommɔne tenaberɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">ne ahonhom efi nyinaa atɛeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">Nnomaa a wɔyɛ efi a wɔkyiri wɔn nyinaa te ne mu.<verse eid="REV 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3"/>Ɔde ne nsã a ɛyɛ nʼadwamammɔ a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">ano yɛ den no maa nnipa nyinaa nomeeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">Asase so ahene ne no bɔɔ adwaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">na asase so adwadifoɔ nam nʼahonya mmorosoɔ so nyaa wɔn ho.”<verse eid="REV 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4"/>Afei, metee nne foforɔ bi a ɛfiri ɔsoro ka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">“Momfiri, me nkurɔfoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">na moamfa mo ho amfra bɔne a ɔyɛ no mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">na mo ne no ankyɛre nʼasotweɛ!<verse eid="REV 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, wɔahyehyɛ ne bɔne atoatoa abɛduru soro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">na Onyankopɔn akae nʼawudie no.<verse eid="REV 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6"/>Sɛdeɛ ɔyɛɛ mo no, monyɛ no saa pɛpɛɛpɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">deɛ ɔyɛɛ mo biara no, montua ne so ka mprenu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">Nsa a ɔde maa mo no, monhyɛ no deɛ ano yɛ den mmɔho mmienu.<verse eid="REV 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7"/>Momma nʼayayadeɛ ne nʼawerɛhoɔ nnɔɔso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">sɛ animuonyam ne ahonya a ɔpɛ maa ne ho no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Ɛfiri sɛ, daa ɔka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">‘Mete ha sɛ ɔhemmaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">menyɛ okunafoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">na me werɛ renho da!’<verse eid="REV 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8"/>Yei enti, nʼamanehunu a ɛyɛ yadeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">awerɛhoɔ ne ɛkɔm bɛba ne so da bi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Na wɔde ogya ahye no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">ɛfiri sɛ, Awurade Onyankopɔn a ɔbu no atɛn no yɛ kɛseɛ.<verse eid="REV 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9"/>“Sɛ asase so ahene a wɔne no bɔɔ adwaman, dii dɛ no hunu hye a wɔrehye no no wisie a, wɔbɛsu atwa agyaadwoɔ. <verse eid="REV 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10"/>Nʼamanehunu no hu a ɛyɛ enti, wɔbɛgyina akyiri asu sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">“ ‘Due! Due, Ao, kuropɔn kɛseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">Ao Babilonia, kuropɔn a ɛwɔ tumi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">Dɔnhwere baako pɛ mu, wʼatemmuo aba.’<verse eid="REV 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11"/>“Adwadifoɔ a wɔwɔ asase so nso su no ɛfiri sɛ, obiara ntɔ wɔn nneɛma bio. <verse eid="REV 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12"/>Obiara ntɔ sikakɔkɔɔ ne dwetɛ, ne aboɔden aboɔ ne nhweneɛ pa, ne nwera pa ne ntoma afasebire ne serekye ne tam kɔkɔɔ, ne nnua a ɛyɛ hwam nyinaa ne asonse adwinneɛ nyinaa, ne adwinneɛ a wɔde nnua a ɛwɔ din ayɛ, ne ayowaa ne dadeɛ ne abohemaa, <verse eid="REV 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13"/>ne pɛperɛ ne mmorɔngo, ne nnuhwam ne kurobo, ne hwamfufuo ne nsã ne ngo, ne asikyiresiam muhumuhu ne ayuo, ne nyɛmmoa ne nnwan ne apɔnkɔ ne nteaseɛnam ne nkoa ne nnipa akra.<verse eid="REV 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14"/>“Adwadifoɔ no bɛka sɛ, ‘Nneɛma pa a wopere hwehwɛeɛ no nyinaa ayera, na wʼahonya ne wʼanimuonyam no kɔ, na wo nsa renka bio.’ <verse eid="REV 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15"/>Adwadifoɔ a wɔnyaa wɔn ho wɔ kuro no mu no bɛgyina akyirikyiri ɛfiri sɛ, wɔsuro amanehunu a ɔrehunu no. Wɔbɛsu na wɔatwa agyaadwoɔ, <verse eid="REV 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16"/>na wɔaka sɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">“ ‘Due! Due, Ao, kuropɔn kɛseɛ a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">ɔfira nwera pa ne ntoma afasebire ne tam kɔkɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">na sika ne aboɔden aboɔ ne nhwene pa bobɔ mu.<verse eid="REV 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17"/>Dɔnhwere pɛ, na saa ahonya dodoɔ yi asɛe.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">“Ahyɛnkafoɔ panin ne ɛhyɛn no mu nnipa, ne ɛhyɛn no mu adwumayɛfoɔ, ne wɔn a wɔka ho a wɔnya wɔn anoduane firi ɛhyɛn adwumayɛ mu no nyinaa gyinaa akyirikyiri. <verse eid="REV 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18"/>Wɔsuiɛ wɔ ɛberɛ a wɔhunuu ogya a ɛrehyeɛ no wisie no, wɔteam ka sɛ ‘Kuropɔn biara a ne kɛseɛ te sɛi mmaa da.’ ” <verse eid="REV 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19"/>Wɔtoo mfuturo guu wɔn atifi na wɔsu twaa agyaadwoɔ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">“ ‘Due! Due Ao kuropɔn kɛseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">wo a wɔn a wɔwɔ ahyɛn wɔ wo mu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">nam wʼahonya so yɛɛ adefoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">Na dɔnhwereɛ baako pɛ mu, wɔahwere biribiara!’<verse eid="REV 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20"/>“Ma wʼani nnye ne ho. Ao, ɔsoro!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">Ahotefoɔ ne asomafoɔ ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">adiyifoɔ mo ani nnye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">Ɛkwan a ɔde mo faa so enti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">Onyankopɔn abu no atɛn.”<verse eid="REV 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21"/>Afei, ɔbɔfoɔ hoɔdenfoɔ bi faa ɛboɔ a ne kɛseɛ bɛyɛ sɛ owiyammoɔ to twenee ɛpo mu kaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">“Saa ahoɔden yi ara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">na wɔde bɛto Babilonia kɛseɛ no atwene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">a wɔrenhunu no bio.<verse eid="REV 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22"/>Wɔrente sankubɔfoɔ ne nnwomtofoɔ, atɛntɛbɛnbɔfoɔ ne totorobɛntohyɛnfoɔ nka bio wɔ mo mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">Wɔrenhunu odwumfoɔ biara wɔ wo mu bio.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">Na wɔrente owiyamfoɔ biara nka wɔ wo mu bio.<verse eid="REV 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23"/>Kanea hann</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">renhyerɛn wɔ wo mu bio.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Wɔrente ayeforɔkunu ne ayeforɔyere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">nne wɔ wo mu bio.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Wʼadwadifoɔ yɛ ewiase mu nnipa titire.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">Na wɔde wo ntafowayie adaadaa aman nyinaa.<verse eid="REV 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24"/>Wɔ ne mu na wɔhunuu adiyifoɔ ne ahotefoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">ne wɔn a wɔkumm wɔn asase so nyinaa mogya.”<verse eid="REV 18:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Nnipakuo A Wɔwɔ Ɔsoro No Ani Gye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1"/>Yei akyi no, metee nne bi te sɛ nnipakuo a wɔwɔ ɔsoro reteam sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">“Haleluia!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">Nkwagyeɛ ne animuonyam ne tumi wɔ yɛn Onyankopɔn,<verse eid="REV 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2"/>ɛfiri sɛ, nʼatemmuo yɛ nokorɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">na ɛyɛ sɛ ɔbuu odwamanfoɔ kɛseɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">a ɔde nʼadwamammɔ asɛe asase no atɛn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Onyankopɔn atwe nʼaso ɛfiri sɛ, ɔkumm nʼasomfoɔ.”<verse eid="REV 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3"/>Na afei, wɔteaam bio sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">“Haleluia!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">Wisie bɛfiri kuro no mu akɔ ɔsoro daa daa.”<verse eid="REV 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4"/>Mpanimfoɔ aduonu ɛnan ne ateasefoɔ baanan no butubutuu Onyankopɔn a ɔte nʼahennwa so no anim somm no. Na wɔteaam sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:4">“Amen, Haleluia!”<verse eid="REV 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5"/>Afei, nne bi firi ahennwa no so baa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">“Monkamfo yɛn Onyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">mo a moyɛ nʼasomfoɔ nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">mo a mosuro no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">akɛseɛ ne nkumaa!”<verse eid="REV 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6"/>Afei, metee nne bi te sɛ nnipadɔm a ɛte sɛ nsuworosoɔ ne aprannaa a ɛrepaapae a ɛreteam sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">“Haleluia!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:6">Yɛn Otumfoɔ Awurade Onyankopɔn di ɔhene.<verse eid="REV 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7"/>Momma yɛn ho nsɛpɛ yɛn na yɛn ani nnye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">na yɛnhyɛ no animuonyam!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">Ɛfiri sɛ Odwammaa no ayeforɔhyia aduru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">na nʼayefokunu asiesie ne ho.<verse eid="REV 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8"/>Wɔde nwera pa a ani hyerɛn na ani teɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:8">maa no sɛ ɔnhyɛ.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 19:8">(Nwera no kyerɛ ahotefoɔ tenenee nneyɛɛ.)<verse eid="REV 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9"/>Afei, ɔbɔfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Twerɛ sɛ, Nhyira nka wɔn a wɔato nsa afrɛ wɔn Odwammaa no ayeforɔhyia anwummerɛ apontoɔ ase.” Ɔka kaa ho sɛ, “Yei yɛ Onyankopɔn asɛm turodoo.”<verse eid="REV 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10"/>Mebutuu ne nan ase pɛɛ sɛ mesom no. Nanso, ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Nyɛ saa, ɛfiri sɛ, meyɛ ɔsomfoɔ te sɛ wo ne wo nuanom a wɔdi Yesu ho adanseɛ no. Som Onyankopɔn ɛfiri sɛ, nokorɛ a Yesu daa no adi no na ɛhyɛ adiyifoɔ no nkuran.”<verse eid="REV 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahene Mu Ɔhene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11"/>Afei, mehunuu sɛ ɔsoro abue a ɔpɔnkɔ fitaa wɔ hɔ. Na deɛ ɔte ne so no edin de “Ɔseadeɛyɛ ne Ɔnokwafoɔ.” Nokorɛ na ɔgyina so bu atɛn na ɔko ne ko. <verse eid="REV 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12"/>Nʼaniwa te sɛ ogya a ɛrederɛ na ɔhyɛ ahenkyɛ bebree. Na ɔwɔ din bi a wɔatwerɛ agu ne ho, nanso na obiara nnim edin no nkyerɛaseɛ ka ne ho. <verse eid="REV 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13"/>Na ɔhyɛ atadeɛ bi a wɔde anu mogya mu. Na ne din ne “Onyankopɔn Asɛm” <verse eid="REV 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14"/>Ɔsoro asraafoɔ a wɔhyehyɛ nwera fitaa a ani te a wɔtete apɔnkɔ fitafitaa so dii nʼakyi. <verse eid="REV 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15"/>Akofena a ano yɛ nnam yie a ɔde bɛdi aman so firii nʼanom baeɛ. Dadeɛ poma na ɔde bɛdi wɔn so. Sɛdeɛ wɔtiatia bobe a ɛwɔ nsakyiamena mu no so no, saa ara na ɔbɛtiatia nnipa no so de akyerɛ Onyankopɔn Otumfoɔ no abufuo. <verse eid="REV 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16"/>Na wɔatwerɛ edin agu nʼatadeɛ mu ne ne srɛ ho sɛ:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 19:16">ahene mu ɔhene ne awuranom mu awurade.<verse eid="REV 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17"/>Afei, mehunuu ɔbɔfoɔ bi a ɔgyina owia mu. Ɔteaam guu nnomaa a wɔnam ewiem nyinaa so sɛ, “Mommra mmɛhyiam wɔ Onyankopɔn apontoɔ kɛseɛ no ase. <verse eid="REV 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18"/>Mommɛdi ahemfo nam ne asafohene nam ne atumfoɔ nam ne apɔnkɔ ne wɔn sotefoɔ nam ne adehyeɛ ne nkoa ne akɛseɛ ne nkumaa nyinaa nam.”<verse eid="REV 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19"/>Afei, mehunuu aboa no ne asase so ahene ne wɔn asraafoɔ a wɔaboa wɔn ho ano rekɔko atia deɛ ɔte ɔpɔnkɔ no so no ne ne dɔm. <verse eid="REV 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20"/>Wɔkyeree aboa no ne nʼatorɔdiyifoɔ a ɔyɛɛ anwanwadeɛ maa no no. Saa anwanwadeɛ no so na ɔnam daadaa wɔn a wɔde aboa no ahyɛ wɔn agyiraeɛ ne wɔn a wɔsom aboa no ohoni no. Wɔtoo aboa no ne atorɔdiyifoɔ no anikann guu ogya ɔtadeɛ a sɔfe na na ɛrederɛ wɔ mu no mu. <verse eid="REV 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21"/>Wɔde akofena a ɛfiri ɔpɔnkɔkafoɔ no anom kunkumm wɔn asraafoɔ, na nnomaa no dii wɔn nam sɛdeɛ wɔbɛtumi.<verse eid="REV 19:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Mfeɛ Apem Afiase Nna Ne Ahennie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1"/>Afei, mehunuu ɔbɔfoɔ bi sɛ ɔfiri ɔsoro reba fam a na ɔkura ebunu no safoa ne nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn duruduru bi. <verse eid="REV 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2"/>Ɔkyeree ɔtweaseɛ kɛseɛ dada a ɔyɛ ɔbonsam no kyekyeree no mfeɛ apem. <verse eid="REV 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ no too no twenee ebunu no mu, too mu safoa sɔɔ ano sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, mfeɛ apem no bɛtwam. Ɛno akyi wɔbɛgyaa no kakra.<verse eid="REV 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4"/>Afei, mehunuu nhennwa ne wɔn a wɔtete so a wɔama wɔn tumi sɛ wɔmmu atɛn. Afei mehunuu wɔn a ɛsiane sɛ wɔada nokorɛ ne Onyankopɔn asɛm a Yesu kaeɛ no adi enti, wɔatwitwa wɔn ti no akra. Wɔansom aboa no ne ne honi no. Saa ara nso na wɔamfa aboa no agyiraeɛhyɛdeɛ anhyɛ wɔn moma so ne wɔn nsa ho agyiraeɛ. Wɔbaa nkwa mu ne Kristo bɛdii ahene mfeɛ apem. Awufoɔ a wɔaka no annyane kɔsii mfeɛ apem no akyi. <verse eid="REV 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5"/>Yei ne awufosɔreɛ a ɛdi ɛkan. <verse eid="REV 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6"/>Nhyira bebree nka wɔn a wɔdii ɛkan nyanee wɔn firii awufoɔ mu. Owuo a ɛtɔ so mmienu no nni wɔn so tumi. Wɔbɛyɛ Onyankopɔn ne Kristo asɔfoɔ. Na wɔne no bɛdi ahene mfeɛ apem.<verse eid="REV 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7"/>Mfeɛ apem no akyi, wɔbɛyi ɔbonsam afiri afiase hɔ; <verse eid="REV 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8"/>na ɔbɛkɔ akɔdaadaa aman a ɛwɔ ewiase nyinaa a ɛyɛ Gog ne Magog. Ɔbonsam bɛboaboa wɔn ano a wɔn dodoɔ bɛyɛ sɛ mpoano anwea de wɔn akɔ ɔko. <verse eid="REV 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9"/>Wɔtuu sa kɔɔ asase so nyinaa kɔtwaa Onyankopɔn nkurɔfoɔ atenaeɛ, a ɛyɛ ɔman a ɔdɔ no no ho hyiaeɛ. Nanso, ogya firi soro bɛsɛee wɔn. <verse eid="REV 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10"/>Ɛnna wɔtoo ɔbonsam a ɔdaadaa wɔn no nso too ogya tadeɛ ne sɔfe a wɔde aboa no ne atorɔ odiyifoɔ no ato mu no mu. Na wɔbɛyɛ wɔn ayayadeɛ awia ne anadwo daa daa.<verse eid="REV 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atemmuo A Ɛtwa Toɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11"/>Afei, mehunuu ahennwa fitaa kɛseɛ bi ne deɛ ɔte so no. Asase ne ɔsoro dwanee wɔ nʼanim, na wɔanhunu wɔn bio. <verse eid="REV 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12"/>Na mehunuu awufoɔ akɛseɛ ne nketewa sɛ wɔgyinagyina ahennwa no anim. Wobuebuee nwoma bebree mu, ɛnna wobuee nwoma foforɔ bi a ɛyɛ ateasefoɔ nwoma no mu. Wɔbuu awufoɔ no atɛn, sɛdeɛ wɔn nnwuma te ne sɛdeɛ wɔatwerɛ wɔ nwoma ahodoɔ no mu no. <verse eid="REV 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13"/>Afei, ɛpo nso danee nʼawufoɔ maeɛ. Owuo ne asaman nso de wɔn awufoɔ maeɛ. Na wɔbuu wɔn nyinaa atɛn sɛdeɛ wɔn nnwuma teɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14"/>Na wɔtoo owuo ne asaman guu ogya tadeɛ no mu. Saa ogya tadeɛ yi ne owuprenu no. <verse eid="REV 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15"/>Na obiara a wɔantwerɛ ne din angu nkwa nwoma no mu no, wɔtoo no twenee ogya tadeɛ no mu.<verse eid="REV 20:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsoro Foforɔ Ne Asase Foforɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1"/>Afei, mehunuu ɔsoro foforɔ ne asase foforɔ, na kane ɔsoro ne kane asase no atwam, na ɛpo nso nni hɔ bio. <verse eid="REV 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2"/>Na mehunuu Kuro Kronkron a ɛyɛ Yerusalem foforɔ sɛ ɛfiri Onyankopɔn hɔ wɔ ɔsoro reba fam, a wasiesie ne ho te sɛ ayeforɔ a ɔrekɔhyia ne kunu. <verse eid="REV 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3"/>Metee nne denden bi firi ahennwa no so sɛ, “Afei, Onyankopɔn atenaeɛ wɔ nnipa mu. Ɔne wɔn bɛtena na wɔayɛ ne nkurɔfoɔ. Onyankopɔn no ankasa ne wɔn bɛtena na wayɛ wɔn Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="REV 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4"/>Na ɔbɛpepa wɔn aniwa mu nisuo nyinaa. Na owuo nni hɔ bio, na awerɛhoɔ ne osu ne yea nni hɔ bio. Na kane nneɛma no atwam.”<verse eid="REV 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5"/>Afei, deɛ ɔte ahennwa no so no kaa sɛ, “Afei, mereyɛ nneɛma nyinaa foforɔ!” Ɔka kyerɛɛ me nso sɛ, “Twerɛ yei, ɛfiri sɛ, saa nsɛm yi yɛ nokorɛ a wɔde wɔn ho to so.”<verse eid="REV 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Wɔawie! Me ne Alfa ne Omega, Ahyɛaseɛ ne Awieeɛ no. Obiara a sukɔm de no no, mɛma no nsuo a ɛfiri nkwa asutire mu anom kwa. <verse eid="REV 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7"/>Obiara a ɔbɛdi nkonim no bɛnya yei afiri me nkyɛn. Mɛyɛ ne Onyankopɔn na ɔno nso ayɛ me ba. <verse eid="REV 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8"/>Nanso, ahufoɔ ne wɔn a wɔnnye nni ne akyiwadeyɛfoɔ ne awudifoɔ ne adwamanfoɔ ne adutofoɔ ne abosonsomfoɔ ne atorofoɔ nyinaa bɛnya wɔn kyɛfa wɔ ɔtadeɛ a ogya ne sɔfe dɛre wɔ mu no. Ɛno ne owuprenu no.”<verse eid="REV 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Foforɔ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9"/>Abɔfoɔ baason a wɔkurakura nkuruwa nson a ɔhaw nson a ɛtwa toɔ no ahyɛ ma wɔ mu baako baa me nkyɛn bɛkaa sɛ, “Bra, na mɛkyerɛ wo Ayeforɔ a ɔyɛ Odwammaa no yere no.” <verse eid="REV 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10"/>Honhom no faa me, na ɔbɔfoɔ no de me kɔɔ bepɔ tenten bi atifi. Ɔkyerɛɛ me Yerusalem, Kuro Kronkron a ɛfiri ɔsoro, Onyankopɔn hɔ, resiane aba fam. <verse eid="REV 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11"/>Ɛhyerɛn Onyankopɔn animuonyam mu, na ne hyerɛn no te sɛ aboɔdenboɔ a ɛsɛ ahwehwɛboɔ a ani te sɛ ahwehwɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12"/>Na ne ɔfasuo no wɔ ahoɔden na ɛware yie nso. Apono dumienu gu ano a, abɔfoɔ dumienu na wɔhwɛ so. Na ɛpono biara so no wɔatwerɛ Israel mmusuakuo dumienu no mu baako din. <verse eid="REV 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13"/>Apono mmiɛnsa wɔ apueeɛ; mmiɛnsa wɔ anafoɔ; mmiɛnsa wɔ atifi ɛnna mmiɛnsa wɔ atɔeɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14"/>Wɔsii kuro no afasuo sii aboɔ dumienu a wɔatwerɛ Odwammaa no asomafoɔ dumienu no din wɔ so no so.<verse eid="REV 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔkasa kyerɛɛ me no kura sikakɔkɔɔ poma susudua a wɔde bɛsusu kuro no, nʼapono ne nʼafasuo. <verse eid="REV 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16"/>Na kuro no yɛ ahinanan a ne tenten ne ne trɛ yɛ pɛ. Ɔbɔfoɔ no de ne susudua no susuu kuro no. Na ne tenten yɛ kilomita mpem mmienu ne ahanan (2,400), na ne tɛtrɛtɛ, ne ɔsorokɔ ne ne tenten nyinaa yɛ pɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ no susuu ɔfasuo no nso a na ne ɔsorokɔ nso bɛyɛ sɛ mita aduosia. <verse eid="REV 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18"/>Ahwehwɛboɔ na ɔde too afasuo no. Na kuro no deɛ, sikakɔkɔɔ amapa a ɛhyerɛn te sɛ ahwehwɛ na wɔde toeɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19"/>Wɔde aboɔdenboɔ ahodoɔ a ɛyɛ fɛ na ɛhyehyɛɛ kuro no fapem. Fapem a ɛdi ɛkan yɛ ahwehwɛboɔ. Fapem a ɛtɔ so mmienu yɛ aboɔdemmoɔ. Fapem a ɛtɔ so mmiɛnsa yɛ omununkumboɔ. Fapem a ɛtɔ so ɛnan yɛ ahahammonoboɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20"/>Fapem a ɛtɔ so enum yɛ ɛtɔnboɔ. Fapem a ɛtɔ so nsia yɛ bogyanamboɔ. Fapem a ɛtɔ so nson yɛ sikabereɛboɔ. Fapem a ɛtɔ so nwɔtwe yɛ apopobibirieboɔ. Fapem a ɛtɔ so nkron yɛ akraateboɔ. Fapem a ɛtɔ so edu yɛ dɛnkyɛmmoɔ. Fapem a ɛtɔ so dubaako yɛ wisiboɔ. Fapem a ɛtɔ so dumienu yɛ beredumboɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21"/>Na wɔde nhwene pa dumienu na ɛyɛɛ apono dumienu no. Apono no mu biara, wɔde ahene pa baako na ɛyɛeɛ. Na kuro no abɔntene kɛseɛ yɛ sika amapa kronn a ɛte sɛ ahwehwɛ.<verse eid="REV 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22"/>Na manhunu asɔredan wɔ kuro no mu baabiara ɛfiri sɛ, Awurade Onyankopɔn Otumfoɔ ne Odwammaa no ne asɔredan. <verse eid="REV 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23"/>Na owia anaa ɔsrane hann nhia kuro no ɛfiri sɛ, na Onyankopɔn ne Odwammaa no animuonyam hyerɛn wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24"/>Ne hann no bɛhyerɛn asase so aman nyinaa so, na asase so aman so ahene de wɔn ahodeɛ bɛba hɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25"/>Wɔntoto kuro no apono mu. Ɛda biara ano da hɔ. Ɛfiri sɛ, esum nnuru wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26"/>Wɔde aman no kɛseyɛ ne wɔn ahonya bɛba kuro no mu. <verse eid="REV 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27"/>Nanso, biribiara a ɛho nte nkɔ kuro no mu. Saa ara na obi a ɔyɛ aniwudeɛ anaa ɔtwa atorɔ nkɔ mu. Wɔn a wɔatwerɛ wɔn din ahyɛ Odwammaa no nkwa nwoma no mu no nko ara na wɔbɛkɔ kuro no mu.<verse eid="REV 21:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Nkwa Asubɔnten</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ no kyerɛɛ me nkwa asubɔnten a ani te korɔgyenn sɛ ahwehwɛ a ɛfiri Onyankopɔn ne Odwammaa no ahennwa so, <verse eid="REV 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2"/>a ɛtene fa kuro no abɔntene mfimfini. Asuo no fa biara, nkwa dua si hɔ a ɛso aba ahodoɔ dumienu ɔbosome biara. Wɔde ɛso ahahan no sa aman ahodoɔ no yadeɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3"/>Biribiara a ɛwɔ Onyankopɔn nnome ase no nkɔ kuro no mu. Wɔbɛhunu Onyankopɔn ne Odwammaa no ahennwa wɔ kuro no mu na nʼasomfoɔ bɛsom no. <verse eid="REV 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4"/>Wɔbɛhunu nʼanim na wɔbɛtwerɛ ne din agu wɔn moma so. <verse eid="REV 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5"/>Adeɛ rensa wɔ hɔ bio, na nkanea anaa hann ho nhia ɛfiri sɛ, Awurade Onyankopɔn bɛyɛ wɔn hann na wɔbɛdi adeɛ sɛ ahene daa daa.<verse eid="REV 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo Reba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6"/>Afei, ɔbɔfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Saa nsɛm yi yɛ nokorɛ a wode wo ho to so a, ɛyɛ. Na Awurade Onyankopɔn a ɔde Honhom ma adiyifoɔ somaa ne ɔbɔfoɔ sɛ ɔmmɛkyerɛ nʼasomfoɔ deɛ ɛbɛba nnansa yi ara no.”<verse eid="REV 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Montie! Mereba nnansa yi ara, Nhyira nka wɔn a wɔtie adiyisɛm a ɛwɔ saa nwoma yi mu no!”</char><verse eid="REV 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8"/>Me, Yohane, mate na mahunu saa nneɛma yi nyinaa. Na metee ne nyinaa, hunuu ne nyinaa wieeɛ no, mebutuu ɔbɔfoɔ no a ɔkyerɛɛ me saa nneɛma yi nyinaa nan ase pɛɛ sɛ mesom no. <verse eid="REV 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9"/>Nanso, ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Nyɛ saa! Meyɛ ɔsomfoɔ te sɛ wo nuanom adiyifoɔ ne wɔn a wɔdi nwoma yi mu nsɛm no so no ara pɛ. Som Onyankopɔn!”<verse eid="REV 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Nkata saa adiyisɛm a ɛwɔ nwoma yi mu no so, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛberɛ no abɛn. <verse eid="REV 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11"/>Obiara a ɔyɛ bɔne nkɔ so nyɛ bɔne, na deɛ ɔyɛ efi no nkɔ so nyɛ efi; deɛ ɔyɛ papa no nkɔ so nyɛ papa, na deɛ ɔyɛ kronkron no nkɔ so nyɛ kronkron.”<verse eid="REV 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12"/>
    <char style="wj">Hwɛ! Mereba ntɛm! Mekura mʼabasobɔdeɛ sɛ mede rebɛma obiara sɛdeɛ nʼadwumayɛ teɛ.</char> <verse eid="REV 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13"/><char style="wj">Mene Alfa ne Omega, Ɔkannifoɔ ne Okyidifoɔ, Ahyɛaseɛ ne Awieeɛ.</char><verse eid="REV 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nhyira nka wɔn a wɔhoro wɔn ntadeɛ, na wɔn na wɔwɔ ho ɛkwan sɛ wɔdi nkwa dua no aba na wɔfa kuro no ɛpono no mu.</char> <verse eid="REV 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15"/><char style="wj">Na Kuro no akyi na nkraman ne adutofoɔ ne adwamanfoɔ ne awudifoɔ ne abosonsomfoɔ ne wɔn a wɔpɛ atorɔ na wɔdi atorɔ no nyinaa wɔ.</char><verse eid="REV 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Me, Yesu, na masoma me ɔbɔfoɔ sɛ ɔmmɛbɔ mo saa nwoma yi nyinaa ho amaneɛ wɔ asafo mu. Meyɛ Dawid busuani. Mene anɔpa nsoromma a ɛhyerɛn no.”</char><verse eid="REV 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17"/>Honhom no ne ayeforɔ no se, “Ɛsɛ sɛ obiara a ɔte saa asɛm yi nso ka sɛ, ‘Bra!’ Na deɛ osukɔm de no no mmra, na deɛ ɔpɛ no nso, ɔmmɛgye nkwa nsuo no kwa.”<verse eid="REV 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Awieeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18"/>Me, Yohane, mebɔ obiara a ɔte saa adiyisɛm a ɛwɔ nwoma yi mu kɔkɔ sɛ: Sɛ obi de bi ka ho a, Onyankopɔn de asotweɛ bɛka ne haw a wakyerɛ mu wɔ saa nwoma yi mu no ho. <verse eid="REV 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19"/>Na sɛ obi nso yi bi firi adiyisɛm a ɛwɔ saa nwoma yi mu no mu a, Onyankopɔn bɛyi ne kyɛfa a ɔbɛnya wɔ nkwa dua no ne kuro Kronkron a wɔakyerɛkyerɛ mu wɔ nwoma yi mu no.<verse eid="REV 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20"/>Deɛ ɔdi nwoma yi ho adanseɛ no ka sɛ, <char style="wj">“Aane! Mereba ntɛm!”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Amen. Bra, Awurade Yesu!<verse eid="REV 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21"/>Yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo adom nka ahotefoɔ nyinaa. Amen.<verse eid="REV 22:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22"/>
</usx>
